<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">2 Samuel</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Samuel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, Saul sihnung in David Amalekte zoukhin a hong kiknawn a, Jiklag khua ah David ni nih a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichi a honghi a, a ni thum ni’n, ngai in, mi khat Saul panmun a kipan a puante bohkeksa leh a lu a leikai niaunuau in a hongpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David kiang a hongtun in lei a khupboh in zahtakna a pia hi. David in a kiang ah, “Koi apan hongpai na hia?” a chi hi. Aman a kiang ah, “Israel mite panmun apan hong taikhia ka hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in a kiang ah, “Bangchibang in thil a om a? Honhilh dihve” a chi hi. Aman a dawng a, “Kidouna apan mite a taikek ua, mi tampi a puk ua, a si uh. Saul leh a tapa Jonathan leng a si tuaktuak uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David in amah hilhpa tangval kiang ah, “Bangchi in ahia Saul leh a tapa Jonathan a sih uh na theih?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hilhpa tangval in, “Bangchi chi hiam in Gilboa tang ah ka na omkha zenzen hi. Ngai in, a teipi ngai a Saul ding ka mu a, kangtalaite leh sakol tungtuang mite’n a hon naihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nunglam a ngatleh a honmu a, a honsam hi. Ken, ‘Hiai ah ka om,’ chi’n ka dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kiang ah, ‘Kua na hia?’ a honchi hi. Ken, Amalek mi ka hi, chi’n ka dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman ka kiang ah, ‘Ka kiang ah hongding inla hongthat maidih, ka hinglai vanglak a, lungdonna inlah a honmanta ngal a’ a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kiang ah ka ding a, huchi a pukgawp khinsa, damzou nawnlou ding chih ka theih ziak in ka thatta mai hi, a lu a lallukhu leh a ban a tau ka la a, ka pu kiang ah ka hontawi hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in a puansilhte a botkekta a, huchi mah bang in a kiang a mi om tengteng in leng a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saul leh a tapa Jonathan leh Toupa mite leh Israel inkuante a sun ua, a kah ua, nitaklam tan in an a ngawl ua, namsau a thah a hih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in amah vahilh tangval kiang ah, ‘koilam mi na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman, “Gamdang mi, Amalek mi tapa ka hi” chi’n a dawng hi. David in a kiang ah, “ Toupa thaunilh hihmang dia a tung a khutkhak bangchidan a laulou na hia leh?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in tangval khat a sam a, “Vanaih inla, that in,” a chi a, aman a vasat a, a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David in a kiang ah, “Na sisan nangmah lutung ah om hen. Nangmah kamngei in, Toupa thaunilh ka that ahi, chi a na phuantak man in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in Saul leh a tapa Jonathan hiai kahtam in a sun hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thalkap dan Judah suante sinsak din a sawl a, ngai in, Jasher laibu ah hiai gelh ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Aw Israel, na kilawmna munsangte ah a that ua, na mi hatte a pukta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gath ah genkei unla, Ashkelon kongzingte ah phuang kei un. Huchilou in zaw Philistia tanute a kipak ding ua, zeksumlouh tanute a vualzou kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nou Gilboa tangte aw, na tung uah daitui leh vuah ke kei hen. Thillat dingte leng suahsam ken. Huai ah lah mihat lum Saul lum, thaunilh louh mi lum bang mai in gilou tak in a paimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thah a omte sisan apan leh mihat thau apan Jonathan thal a kiknawn kei a, Saul namsau a vuak in a kiknawn kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saul leh Jonathan hindan a deihhuai in a kilawm a, a sih un leng a kikhen kei uhi. Mipite sang in a hatzaw ua, humpinelkaite sang in a hatzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Nou Israel tanute aw, Saul kah un, puansan kilawmte na tung uah a bang a, na puan uah dangkaeng a zephoihnate hon koihsakpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kidou laitak a mihatte a puk maizen uh! Aw, Jonathan, na mun sangte ah nang a hon thatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ka unaupa Jonathan, na tungthu ah ka lungzing petmah hi. Ka tung ah na hoih mahmah a, N’on itna a lamdang hi, numei itna a khup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihatte a puk ua, kidouna galvante leng a mangthang khinta!”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, huai nung in David in “Judah gam a khua khat peuh ah ka hohtou diam?” chi in Toupa a dong hi. Toupa’n a kiang ah, “Hoh tou in,” a chi hi. David in, “Koi ah ahia ka hohtouh ding?” a chi a, Aman, “Hebron ah” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in David huai ah a hohtou a, a zi nihte, Jezreel mi Ahinoam leh Karmel mi Nabal zi Abigail toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in a kiang a om mi tengteng a pitou a, michih a inkuante chiat utoh, Hebron khuate ah a tengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah gam a mite a honghoh ua, huai ah Judah inkawte tung a kumpipa din David thau a nilh uhi. Huchi in, “Saul vuimite Jabesh-gilead mite ahi uh” chi’n David a hilh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jabesh-gilead mite kiang ah David in mite a sawl a, a kiang uah, “Na pu, na pu uh Saul na hehpih dan uh hihlang a na vui ziak un, Toupa’n hon vualzawl hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin Toupa’n na tung uah chitna leh thutak langsak henla; hiai thil na hih ziak un ken leng na chit man uh ka honthuk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin na khutte uh honghat henla, hangsantak in om un. Na pu uh Saul a sita hi. Judah inkawte’n a tung ua kumpipa din thau a honnilh khinta uhi” chi’n a va gensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh Ner tapa Abner, Saul sepaihte heutu in, Saul tapa Ishboshet Mahanaim ah a paipih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gilead, Ashur, Jezreel, Ephraim leh Israel tengteng tung a kumpipa in a bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul tapa Ishboshet in Israel tung a vaihawm apat in kum sawmli a upa ahi a, kum nih sung vai a hawm hi. Himahleh Judah mite’n David a zui uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in Hebron a Judah chite tung ah kum sagih leh khaguk vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ner tapa Abner leh Saul tapa Ishboshet sikhate Mahanaim apan a pawtkhia ua, Gibeon ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zeruiah tapa Joab leh David sikhate a paikhia ua, Gibeon dil ah a kituak uh. Pawl khat dil galkhat lam ah a tu a, pawl khat pen dilgal langkhat ah a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abner in Joab kiang ah, “Tangvalte hong kuan uhenla, i ma uah hong kisual uhen, a chi hi. Joab in, “Hong kuan le uh ake” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in a kuan ua, a zahchiang sep in a galkah phei ua, Benjamin chi, Saul tapa Ishboshet lam a pang sawmlehnih, David sikha sawmlehnih ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A langte uh luchiat ah a kimantuah ua, amau tumte chiat namsau in a nak ah a kidawt ua; a pukkhawm vek uhi. Huaiziak in, huai mun Helkath, hazzurim a chi ua, huai Gibeon a om ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai ni a a kisual uh a thupi mahmah a, Abner leh Israel mite David sikhate ma ah zoh in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai mun ah Zeruiah tapate thum, Joab, Abisai leh Asahel a om uh. Asahel zukpi bang a ngalhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asahel in Abner a delh a; Abner a delh taklam hiam veilam hiam a pialsan hetlou in a delh vengveng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abner a lehngat a “Nang na hi maw, Asahel?” a chi hi. Aman a dawng a, “Ka hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abner in a kiang ah, “Na taklam hiam, na veilam hiam ah pialkhia inla, tangval khat man inla, a galvan laksak in” a chi hi. Himahleh Asahel in amah a delh a pialsan nuam tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abner in Asahel kiang ah, “Hon pialsan in. Bangdia lei a hon satpuk ding ka hia? Na unaupa Joab mel ka mu ngam dia hia?” a chi nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh a pial nuam tuankei hi. Huaiziak in, Abner in a teipi tawlam in a nakguh ngana nuai tak a sun a, a nunglam ah teipi a paisuak a, huai ah a puk a, huai mun ah a sita hi. Hichi ahi a, Asahel puk a, a sihna mun a hongpai teng huai mun ah a khawl zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh, Joab leh Abisai in Abner a delhzui ua; Gibeon gamdai lampi a Giah chin a Ammah tang a tun un ni a tumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Benjamin suante Abner kiang ah a kikaikhawm ua, pawl khat in a kibawl ua, mualvum ah a va dingta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abner in Joab a sam a, “Namsau in hon negai den ding hia? A tawplam in a hong kha mahmah ding, chih na theikei maw? Bang tan ahia a unaute uh delh tawpsan a kiknawn dia mipite hilhlou a na om ding?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joab in, “Pathian hinna lou in ka gen ahi. Bangmah na genlou hile chin zingchiang apan mite paimang khinta ding ua, a unaute uh delhlou ding hi ve un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Joab in pengkul a mut a, mite ading depdup uh. Israel mite a delhta kei ua, kuamah a sual nawnta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abner leh a mite zan khua in phaizang tawn suak a pai in Jordan a kan ua, Bithron a kantan ua, Mahanaim a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Joab bel Abner delh a kiknawnta a, mipi tengteng a kaihkhawm vek leh David sikhate sawmlehkua leh Asahel a kimta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Himahleh David sikhate’n Benjamin mite leh Abner mite za thum leh sawmguk a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Asahel luang a la ua, Bethlehem a a pa han ah a vui uh. Joab leh a mite zankhua in a pai ua, khua vak in Hebron a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul inkuante leh David inkuante sawtpi a kidou ua; David in hatlam a manoh a, Saul inkuante’n hatlouh lam a manoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in Hebron ah tapate a nei a, a ta masapen, Ammon, Jezreel mi Ahinoam lak a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zom Kileab, Karmel mi Nabal zi Abigail lak a ahi. A thumna Absalom, Geshur kumpipa Talmai tanu Makah tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lina Adonijah, Haggith tapa ahi a; a ngana Shephatiah, Abital tapa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A gukna Ithream, David zi Eglah lak a ahi. Hiai teng David tapa Hebron a piangte ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Saul inkuante leh David inkuante a kidou sung un Saul inkuante adin Abner a kihat sak semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul in mei a nei a, a min Rizpah ahi. Amah Aiah tanu ahi. Ishboshet in Abner kiang ah, “Bangdia ka pa mei luppih na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ishboshet thugen in Abner a heh sak mahmah hi. Judahte ui lutang leltak ka hi ahia? Tunitan in na pa Saul inkuante leh a unaute leh a lawmte tung ah chitna ka hihlang a, David khut ah k’on pe kei hi. Hinapi a nang hiai numei tung a khial a n’on ngoh mawk!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in Abner a lohloh in loh henla, huai sang a se zaw in leng. David kiang a Toupa a kichiam bang a, huchibang ngei a tung a ka hih kei leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul inkuante lak apan a gam laksak ding, Israel leh Judahte tung a Dan apan a Beer–sheba tan a David mangtutphah tungding ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in aman Abner dawn himhim leng a dawng theikei, a lau mahmah ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abner in amah sik in David kiang ah mi a sawl a, “Hiai gam kua a ahia? Ka kiang ah thu khung in. Huchi in, ngai in, Israel mi tengteng na lam a pang din ka khut nang lam ah a pang ding” chi in a va gensak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman, “Hi hen. Na kiang ah thu ka khung ding. Himahleh na tung ah thil khat k’on phut hi. Huai hiai ahi. Hong mu dia na hongpai chiang in Saul tanu Mikal n’on pi phot kei leh ka mel na mu theikei ding,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David in Saul tapa Ishboshet kiang ah, “Philistia mite zekvun za khat a ka lei ka zi Mikal honpia in” chi din mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ishboshet in mi a sawl a, a pasal Laish tapa Paltiel mahmah apan a pita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A pasal in a zui a, kap kawm in a nung a zui zel a; Bahurim tan a zui hi. Abner in a kiang ah, Pai in, kiknawn in, a chi hi. Huchi in a kiknawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abner in Israel upate a houpih a, “Tuma siah David na kumpipa ding un na zong uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin na kumpipa un bawl un. Toupa’n David tung tang thu ah, Ka sikha David khut in ka mi Israelte Philistia mite khut apan leh a melma teng khut apan ka hunkhe ding a na chi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abner in Benjamin mite bil a zak in a gen hi. Israel mite leh Benjamin inkuan tengteng in hoih a sak bangbang un Hebron a David bil a zak dia gen ding in Abner a hoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abner leh a mite sawmnih Hebron a David kiang ah a pai uhi. David in Abner leh a kiang a mi sawmnihte adin Ankuang a lui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abner in David kiang ah, “Ka thou dia, na kiang a thu a khun theihna ding un leh na deihthusam bangtak a vai na hawm theihna din Israel mi tengteng ka toupa kiang a kaikhawm ding in ka kuan ding” a chi hi. David in Abner a kuansak a, lungmuang tak in a kuanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai in, David mite leh Joab galdou zou a hongtung ua, gallak tampi a honpua uh. Himahleh Abner bel Hebron a David kiang ah a na om nawn kei hi. A na paikik sak khinta a, amah leng lungmuang tak in a na paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joab leh a kiang a mipi tengteng a hongtun un, Ner tapa Abner kumpipa kiang ah a hoh hi. Aman a na paisak nawn khin a, “Lungmuangtakin a pai nawnta” chi in Joab a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joab kumpipa kiang ah a hoh a, “Na thilhih bangchidan ahia oi? Ngai in, Abner na kiang ah a hong a, bangdia paimang sak a, a paimang vengveng mawk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ner tapa Abner na thei a, nang hon zekhem dia na pawt lam leh na lut lam leh na thilhih peuhmah theih tuma hongpai ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David kiang apan Joab a hongpawt khiak in Abner delh din mi a sawl hi. Sirah a tuileh apan a va pikik uh. Himahleh David in a theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abner Hebron a hongtun in Joab in sim houpih din kulh kongpi ah a pi tuam hi. A unau Asahel sisan pawt thukna din a nakguh ngana nuai tak a dawt a, huchi in a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A nung a David in a zak in, “Ner tapa Abner sisan thu ah keimah leh ka gam Toupa mitmuh in tangtawn in ka siang uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Joab lu tung ah kia henla, a pa inkawte tengteng tung ah toh. Joab inkawte lak ah meima sia vei hiam, phak natna nei hiam, chiangkhun ngai a pai hiam, namsau a si hiam, kial thuak hiam kitatlak lou in hongom hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in a unaupa uh Asahel Gibeon a kidouna a a thah ziak in Joab leh a unau Abisai in Abner a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />David in Joab leh a kiang a mi om tengteng kiang ah, “Na puante uh botkek unla, saiip puan silh unla, Abner sun in a ma ah pai un” a chi hi. David in leng siluang a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Abner Hebron ah a vui ua, kumpipa’n a aw a suak khesakin Abner han ah a kap a, mipi tengteng leng a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Abner a kah a: “Abner, mihai sih in a si dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na khut hen ahi kei a, na khete leng sikkol butsak ahi sam kei. Migiloute ma a mi a puk bang a na puk maizen? a chi hi.” Mi tengteng in a kah nawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huchi in sun a hih lai in mi tengteng David an ne sak din a hongpai uh. Himahleh David in, “Nitum ma a an nek hiam, thil dang hiam leng ka nek leh Pathian in a lohloh honloh hen; huai sang a se zaw in leng” chi in, a kichiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi tengteng in huai a theih un a kipak mahmah uh. Kumpipa thilhih peuhmah in mite a kipaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mi tengteng leh Israel mi tengteng in huai ni’n Ner tapa Abner thah a hih kumpipa thu ahi kei chih a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kumpipa’n mite kiang ah, “Tuni in Israel mi lian, mi thupitak a si, chih thei lou na hi umaw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kumpipa dia thaunilh himah leng, tuni in ka hat kei hi. Hiai Zeruiah tapate kei adin a thuak hak lua uh. Toupa’n thil hoihlou hihmi a gitlouh dungzui zel in thuk hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Saul tapa Ishboshet in Hebron ah Abner a si chih a na zak in a khutte a honghat kei ua, Israel mi tengteng a patau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul tapa Ishboshet in sepaih pawl heutu nih a nei hi. Khat min Baanah ahi a, a dang min Rekab ahi. Amau Benjamin suan Beeroth mi Rimmon tapate ahi uh. Beeroth bel Benjamin nam a sim tel a ngaih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Beeroth khua a mite Gitaim ah a tai ua, tunitan in huai ah a teng uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saul tapa Jonathan in tapa khebai a nei hi. Jezreel apan Saul leh Jonathan tanchin a na theih in kum nga a upa ahi. Amah donnu in a pom a, a taimangpih hi. Hichi ahi a, taimang dia a kintatna lam in a kesak a, a khe a hong baita hi. A min Mephibosheth ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Beeroth mi Rimmon tapate Rekab leh Baanah a pai ua, Ishboshet inn ah sun nisat laitak a lupna a a luplai in a kiang ah a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huit buh la ding hileh kilawm in inn sung lam ah a lut ua, a nakguh ngana nuai tak ah a dawt ua, huchi in Rekab leh a unaupa Baanah a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Inn a valut un a lupna dantan a lupna a lum a vadawt ua, a that ua, a lu a tan ua, a lu a la uh. Arabah kantan in zankhua in a paimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ishboshet lu Hebron ah David kiang ah a honpua ua, kumpipa kiang ah, “Ngai in, nang honthah tum, na melma Saul tapa Ishboshet lu hiai ah a om; Toupa’n ka toupa phu Saul leh a suante tung ah tuni’n a laksakta” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in Beeroth mi Rimmon tapa Rekab leh a unaupa Baanah a dawng a, a kiang uah, “ Toupa ka mangbatna tengteng a hontanpa hinna lou in ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tanchinhoih hontun a kisep in, ‘Ngai in, Saul a sita, chi a mi khat in a hon hilh lai in, amah ka man a, Jiklag ah ka that hi’. Huai a tanchinhoih a hon puakman a ka na piak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi diktat, amah inn sung a a ma lupna tungngei a lum, migilou in a thah uh sisan man na tung uah ka honphut nawnsem dia, leitung apan a lamang kei dia hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in David in a tangvalte thu a pia a, amaute a that uh. A khutte uleh a khete uh a tansak ua, Hebron a dil tung ah a khai uhi. Ishboshet lu bel a la ua, Hebron a Abner han ah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in, Israel chi tengteng Hebron a David kiang ah a hongpai ua, “Ngai in, na guh leh na sa ka hi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hun paisa in leng Saul ka tung ua kumpipa ahihlai a leng Israelte pikhia leh pilutpa na hi. Toupa’n na kiang ah, Ka mi Israelte na vak dia, Israelte tung ah heutu in na om ding, a chi” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel upa tengteng Hebron ah kumpipa kiang ah a hoh uh. Kumpipa David in Hebron ah Toupa ma ah amau toh thu a khung hi. Huchi in Israelte tung a kumpipa din David thau a nilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vai a hawm pattung in David kum sawmthum a upa ahi a, kum sawmli sung vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hebron ah Judahte tung ah kum sagih leh kha guk vai a hawm a; Jerusalem ah Israelte leh Judah tengteng tung ah kum sawmthum leh thum vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa leh a mite huai gam a teng Jebus mite sim din Jerusalem ah a hoh uhi. Huai mite’n David a honglut theihlouh gingta in, David kiang ah, “Hiai ah na honglut hetkei ding. Mittaw leh khebaite’n a hon na dal ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh David in Zion kulh a lazou a, huai David khua ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in huai nin, “Jebus mi sual peuhmahte tuiluanna ah paitou uhenla, David mudah khebai leh mittawte that uheh” a chi hi. Huaiziak in ahi, “Mittaw leh khebaite inn ah a honglut kei ding uh,” a chih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in David kulh ah a teng a, David khua a chi uhi. David in Millo apan a kimvel leh a sunglam ah kulh a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David in Toupa , sepaihte Pathian a kiang a a om ziak in thupi lam a manoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tura kumpipa Hiram in David kiang ah mi a sawl a, sidar singte a khak a, khutsiamte leh suangseksiamte a sawl a, David adin inn a lamsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David in Toupa’n amah Israel mite tung a kumpipa din a kipsak a, a mi Israelte ziak in a lalgam a tawisang chih a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in Hebron a pawtsan nung in Jerusalem apan mei leh zi a nei behlap hi. Huchi in David in tapate leh tanute a neinawn lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem a neihte min hiaite ahi: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan leh Solomon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ibhar, Elishua, Nepheg leh Japhia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elishama, Eliada leh Eliphalet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh Philistia mite’n David Israel mite kumpipa din thau a nilh uh chih a zak un Philistia mi tengteng David zong din a hohtou uh. David in a naza a, kulh sung ah a paisuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Philistia mite Rephaim guam ah a kiphalh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David in, “Philistia mite sual din ka hohtou diam? Amaute ka khut ah n’on pe diam?” chi’n Toupa a dong hi. Toupa’n David kiang ah, “Hoh tou in. Philistia mite na khut ah k’on pe ngeingei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in David Baal-perazim ah a hoh a, huai ah David in amaute a sual a, “ Toupa’n ka melmate tuichin khah bang mai in ka ma ah a hon hihdalh sakta” a chi hi. Huaiziak in huai mun min “Baal-perazim” a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huai ah a milim pathiante uh a nusia ua, David leh a mite’n a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Philistia mite a paitou nawn ua, Rephaim guam ah a kiphalh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />David in Toupa a dot leh Aman, “Hoh tou ken. A nunglam uah khelh inla, singtheimi kung zawn ah sual in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hichi ahi ding, singtheimi lek a pai husa na zak leh gamtang in. Philistia sepaihte sual din na ma ah Toupa a kuankheta chihna ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n thu a piak bang in David in a hih a; Philistia mite Geba apan Gazer tan in a sual hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in Israel mite lak a mi teltuam sing thum a kaikhawm nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in David a thou a, Judah gam a Baale khua apan cherubte tung a tuang sepaihte Toupa min a put sak uh Pathian bawm latou din a kiang a mi om tengteng toh a kuanta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian bawm kangtalai thak ah a koih ua, Abinadab in apan a la khia uh. Abinadab tapa Uzzah leh Ahio in kangtalai thak a hawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abinadab inn apan Pathian bawm a la khia ua; Pathian bawm ma ah Ahio a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David leh Israel mi tengteng in Toupa ma ah thil gingthei chi tuamtuam meilah sing a bawl leh kaihgingte, pekgingte, khuangtate, pengkul bineite, dakkhutbette a tum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nakon a buhphual a tunun, Uzzah in Pathian bawm a sawka, a len a; bawng in a hoisak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uzzah tung ah Toupa hehna a kuang a, a thilhih diklouh ziak in Pathian in huai ah a that a, Pathian bawm kiang ah a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa hehna Uzzah tung a a puahzak ziak in David a lungkim kei a, huai mun Perez-uzzah a sa a, tuni tan ahilai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai ni’n David in Toupa a lauta hi. “Bangchi’n Toupa Bawm ka kiang a hongtung theita dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David in Toupa Bawm David khua a amah kiang ah a suan nuam kei hi. Himahleh David in Git mi Obed-edom inn ah a koih zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa Bawm Git mi Obed-edom inn ah kha thum a om hi. Huchi in Obed-edom leh a inkuan tengteng Toupa’n a vualzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pathian Bawm ziak in, Obed-edom inkuan leh a neih leh lam tengteng Toupa’n a vualzawl” chi’n kumpipa David a hilh uh. Huchi in David in Pathian Bawm Obed-edom in apan, David khua ah kipaktak in a valata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Toupa Bawm zawng mite kal guk a suan tak un bawngtal leh gan vakthau a lan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David Toupa ma ah a theihtawp in a lam a, puanmalngat puanak a silh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in David leh Israel mi tengteng in kikou zuazua leh pengkul mut kawm in Toupa Bawm a latouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Toupa Bawm David khua a a lutlai in, Saul tanu Mikal in tohlet apan a na en a, Toupa ma a David tawm leh lam a mu a, a lungtang in a simmohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa Bawm a la lut ua, a koihna dia David in a kaih, puanin sung a amun ding ah a koihta uhi. David in haltum thillatte leh lemna thillatte Toupa ma ah a lan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David in haltum thillatte leh lemna thillatte a latkhit in sepaihte Toupa min in mite a vualzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi tengteng a numei a pasal michih tanghou phel khat leh sabak khat leh grep gah phoukeu bawm khatchiat a pia hi. Huchi in michih amah inlam chiat ah a paita uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hiaizoh in a inkuante vualzawl din David a paikik hi. Saul tanu Mikal David dawn din a hongpawt a, “Tuni in Israel kumpipa thupi hina mai e, miginalou, zumna theilou kisuah khia bang mai in tuni in a sikha nungakte mitmuh in a kisuahkhia hi” a na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />David in Mikal kiang ah, “Na pa leh a inkuante tengteng sang a kei hon tel, Toupa , Israelte tung a kumpipa dia hon seppa Toupa ma ah ahi. Huaiziak in Toupa ma ah ka lam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hiai sang mah in leng ka zumpihhuai lai ding. Keimah mitmuh in leng ka sithuai lai ding. Himahleh huai sikha nungak na gente pahtawi in ka om ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in Saul tanu Mikal in a sihni tanpha in ta a neikei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, kumpipa a inn a om a, Toupa’n a kimvel a melmate tengteng apan galmuanga a omsak nung in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa’n zawlnei Nathan kiang ah, “Tuin en in kei sidar sing inn ah ka teng a, himahleh Pathian bawm puanin ah a om” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nathan in kumpipa kiang ah, “Na lungsim a om bangtak in va hih in, Toupa na kiang ah a om hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, huai zan mah in Toupa thu Nathan kiang ah a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ka sikha David vahilh in, Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Ka tenna ding inn n’on lamsak ding maw?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel suante Aigupta gam apan ka pikhiak apan tunitan in inn ah ka tengkei a, puanin ah leh biakbuk ah ka teng zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel suante lak a ka paina tengteng ah leng, ka mi Israel vak dia thu ka piak vaihawmmite kiang ah, “Bangdia sidar sing a inn hon lamsak lou?” chi in ka gen ngei ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in, ka sikha David kiang ah, Sepaihte Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Belam tatna mun apan belam na ven lai in ka mi Israel mite tung a heutu din k’on la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na hohna peuh ah na kiang ah ka om zel a, na ma ah na melmate ka hihmang zel hi. Lei a mi thupitakte bang in min thupitak k’on bawlsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai ban ah ka mi Israelte adin mun ka sep dia, amau ka suan ding a, amau mun mah ah a teng ding ua, tuma lam bang in gitlouhna tate’n a hih genthei nawn kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na melmate tengteng lak apan k’on khawlsak hi. Huailou him in Toupa’n inn k’on bawlsak ding, chi in a honhilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ni a bei a na pute kiang a na lup chiang in, nanung a na suan, na gil a gah ding ka tungding dia, a gam ka hihkip ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman ka min adin inn a lam dia, a gam mangtutphah tangtawn adin ka hihkip ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pa ka hi ding a, amah ka tapa ahi ding. Thil a hihkhelh leh, mihing chiang leh mihing tate khetna in ka thunun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh, na ma a ka suanmang Saul kiang apan ka lakmang bang in ka chitna in a hon paisan kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na inkuan leh na gam tangtawn a hihkip ngiungeu ahi dia, na mangtutphah lah tangtawn a hihkip ahi ding, chi’n Toupa thu a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai thute tengteng bangzel leh huai kilak na banggeih in Nathan in David kiang ah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa David a lut a, Toupa ma ah a tu hi. “ Toupa Pathian aw, kua ahia ka hih a, ka inkuante bang ahia a hih uh, hiai tantan n’on pi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa Pathian aw, huaite leng nang mitmuh in thil bangmah tham ahi kei uh. Himahleh na sikha inkuan omdan ding thu kum tampi sung a din leng na gen khinta hi. Toupa Pathian aw, hiaite mihing hihdan ahi ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />David in na kiang ah bang a gennawn tuan ding a? Toupa Pathian aw, na sikha lah na thei vek ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na sikha theih din na thu ziak leh nangmah lungtang bangzel in hiai thil thupi tengteng na hihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa Pathian aw, nang na thupi hi. Ka bil ua ka zak bang un nang bang kuamah a omkei a, nangmah loungal Pathian a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aigupta gam apan leh namte leh a pathiante ua apan tankhia a, min bawlsak ding leh na gam adia na mite ma a thil thupitak leh thil lauhuai tak hih ding na mi Israelte bang khovel ah namdang kua a om a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in Israel mite tangtawn a na mite a hong hihtheihna ding un nang adin na hihkipta hi. Toupa , nang a Pathian uh na hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa Pathian aw, na sikha tungtang thu leh a inkuante tungtang thu na gen tangtawn adin hihkip inla, na gensa bang in hih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa Israelte Pathian ahi, chi in na min tangtawn in pahtawi in om hen. Huchi in na sikha David inkuante na ma ah hihkip in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa aw, Israel Pathian, na sikha kiang ah, inkuan k’on phuhsak ding, chi in lah na phuangta ngal a. Huaiziak in na sikha in hiai thumna na kiang k’on tun ngam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuin Toupa Pathian aw, nang huai Pathian na hi a, na thudik hen, hiai thil hoih na sikha kiang ah na chiamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuin na sikha inkuante na ma a tangtawn a a om gige theihna ding un vualzawl in. Toupa Pathian aw, nang lah na genta ngal a. Na vualzawlna in na sikha inkuante tangtawn in vualzawl in om uhen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, huai nung in hichi ahi a, David in Philistia mite a sual a, a zou hi. Huchi in David in Philistia mite khut apan Metheg ammah a lak khiatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab mite a sual a, lei ah a lumsak a, khau in a teh a; vual nih a that a, vual khat bel a hinghawi hi. Huchi in Moab mite David sikhate a hong hita ua, thilpiakte a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in Euphrates lui a, gam la nawn dia hoh in Zobah kumpipa Rehob tapa Hadadezer leng a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in David in a sakol tungtuangmi sang khat leh za sagih leh lei sepaih sing nih a matsak hi. Huchi in kangtalai kai ding za khat chihlouh sakol tengteng a tha uh a sattan sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Damaska a Suria mite Zobah kumpipa Hadadezer huh dia kuante David in Suria mite lak a mi sing nih leh sang nih a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in David in Suria gam a Damaska ah sepaih a koih hi. Suria mite David sikhate a hong hita ua, siah a liau uhi. Toupa’n a hohna peuh ah David a vualzou sakzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in Hadadezer pawlte dangkaeng lumte a laksak a, Jerusalem ah a paipih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hadadezer khopite Betah leh Berothai apan David in dal tampi a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hamath kumpipa Toi in Hadadezer sepaih tengteng David in a zou chih a zak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hadadezer a sual a, a zou chih a zak in chibai buk ding leh vualzawl din Toi in a tapa Joram David kiang ah a sawl a; David in lah Hadadezer dou in a na that khinta hi. Huchi in Joram in dangka belte, dangkaeng belte leh dal belte a hontawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaite leh namdang a zoh tengteng apan a lak dangka leh dangkaeng kumpipa David in Toupa kiang ah a lan hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suriate, Moabte, Ammon suante, Philistiate, Amalekte leh Zobah kumpipa Rehob tapa Hadadezer a kipan a gallakte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David chiguam ah Suria mi sing khat leh sang giat a vathat a, a pailam in a minthang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Edom ah sepaih a koih a; Edom gam teng ah sepaih a koih hi. Huchi in Edom mi tengteng David sikha a hong hita uh. Huchi in Toupa’n David a paina peuh ah a vualzou sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in David in Israel mi tengteng tung ah vai a hawm a; David in a mitengteng tung ah diktattak in vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zeruiah tapa Joab sepaih heutu pen ahi. Ahilud tapa Jehosaphat bel tanchin gelhpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahitub tapa Zadok leh Abiathar tapa Ahimelek siampute ahi ua; Serai bel Laigelhmi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehoiada tapa Benai Kereth mi leh Pelet mite heutu ahi ua, David tapate bel vaihawmtu liante ahi uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in, “Jonathan ziak a hehpihna ka latsak theihna ding in Saul inkawte lak a mi a omlai a om hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul inkawte sikha khat a min Jiba a om hi. David kiang a hoh din a sam uhi. Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Jiba na hi hia?” a chi a; aman, “Na sikha amah ka hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Pathian hehpihna ka latsak theihna di’n Saul inkawte lak a mi omlai omlou uhia? a chi hi. Jiba in kumpipa kiang ah, Jonathan in tapa khat a neilai a, khebai ahi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Kaw om ahia?” a chi hi. Jiba in kumpipa kiang ah, “Ngai in, Lodebar ah Amiel tapa Makir inn ah a om” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa David in mi a sawl a, Lodebar apan Ammiel tapa Makir inn apan mi a va pisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul tapa Jonathan tapa Mephibosheth David kiang ah a honghi. A mai a leisi in zahtakna a pia hi. David in, “Mephibosheth,” a chi a; aman, “En in, na sikha” chi’n, a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in a kiang ah, “Lau ken. Na pa Jonathan ziak in hehpihna k’on musak ngeingei ding. Na pu Saul gam tengteng k’on penawn dia, ka dohkan ah an na ne gige ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in a kun a, “Ui sisa banglel n’on limsak, kei na sikha bang ka hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Saul sikha Jiba a sam a, a kiang ah, “Saul thil neih tengteng leh a inkawte thil tengteng na pu tapa ka pevek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah adin lei na lehsak dia, nang leh na tapate leh na sikhate teng in na pu tapa in nekding a neihtheihna di’n na sepkhiakte na honla ding. Na pu tapa Mephibosheth in bel ka dohkan ah an a um gige ding” a chi hi. Jiba in tapa sawmlehnga leh sikha sawmnih a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Jiba in kumpipa kiang ah, Kumpipa ka toupa’n a sikha thu a piak bangzel in na sikha in a hih ding, a chi hi. Kumpipa’n, “Mephibosheth in ka dohkan ah kumpipa tapa bang in an a um ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mephibosheth in tapa naupang a nei a, a min Mik ahi. Jiba inn a om tengteng Mephibosheth sikhate ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Mephibosheth Jerusalem ah a tengta hi. Kumpipa dohkana an a um gige ziak in; a khe langtuak bai ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, huai nung in Ammon suante kumpipa a si a, a tapa Hanun in a mun ah vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in, “Apan a hon na hehpih bang in ken leng Nahash tapa Hanun ka hehpih sam ding” a chi hi. Huchi in David in a pa tungtang thu a lungmuan din amah mite a sawl a, huchi in David mite Ammon suante gam a va tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh Ammon suante makaite’n a toupa uh Hanun kiang ah, “David in na pa a zahtak ziak a na kiang a lungmuanmi honsawl hi in na um ahia? David in na mite khuate a hong hihsiatna dia zongkhe ding leh enkhe dia honsawl ahi ka hia?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in, Hanun in David mite a man a, a khamul langkhat uh a metsak a, a puansilhte uh a laitak ah a taw uh phazou lel in a tansak a, a sawlkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David a hilhtak un, amau dawn ding mi a sawl hi. Amau lah a zum mahmah ngal ua. Kumpipa’n, “Na khamul uh a selsau ma in Jeriko ah omtadih unla, huai nung in hong paikik un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ammon suante’n David huatlam a na hihta uh, chih a theih un, Ammon suante’n Beth rehob a Suriate leh Zobah a Suriate sepaih sing nih leh kumpipa Maka mi sang khat, Tob mite sing khat leh sang nih toh a thukhak in a guai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in huai a zak in Joab leh sepaih hangsan tengteng a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ammon suante a hong kuan ua, kholutna kongkhak lam ah panmun a khoh uh. Zobah a mite leh Rehob a Suriate leh Tob leh Makate bel a tuam in pawn ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in a malam uh leh a nunglam uah a honsual ding uh chih Joab in a theih in, Israel mite lak a mi hoih tata telkhia a, Suria mite sual din panmun a na khoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Midang tengteng a unaupa Abisai khut ah a koihvek a, Ammon suante sual din panmun a khoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Suria mite ka zoh kei ding leh, nang n’on huh dia, Ammon suante na zoh kei ding leh ken k’on huh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hangtak in om unla, i mite leh i Pathian khua hum in i kipasal sak ding uh. Toupa’n hoih a sak bangbang in hih hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in Joab leh a kiang a mite’n Suria mite sual din kidouna mun a naih ua; a ma uah a taikek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ammon suante’n Suria mite a taikek uh chih a theih un amau leng Abisai ma ah a taikek samta ua, khosung ah a lut uhi. Joab in Ammon suante a kiksan a, Jerusalem ah a paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Suria mite’n Israelte ma ah thah in a om uh chih a kitheih un a ki kaikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hadadezer in mi a sawl a, Lui khenlam a Suria mite a pikhia a, Hadadezer sepaih heutu Sobak in makai in lehlam ah a hongpai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai David a hilh ua, aman Israel mi tengteng a samkhawm a, Jordan luikan in Helam ah a pai uhi. David dou din Suria mite’n panmun khoh in a hong dou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Suria mite Israelte ma ah a taikek ua, David in Suria mi kangtalai za sagih tung a tuang leh sakol tung tuang mi sing li a that a, a sepaih heutu uh Sobak leng a that a, huai ah a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Hadadezer sikha a om kumpipa tengteng in Israelte ma ah tamtak thah ahi uh chih a theih un, Israelte toh kilemna a bawl ua, a sikha un a omta uh. Huchi in Suria mite’n Ammon suante a panpih ngam nawn kei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, hichi ahi a, kum a hong kivei a, kumpipate galdou dia a kuankhiak lai un, David in Joab leh a sikhate tengteng a sawl a, Ammon suante a hihmang ua, Rabah khua a umkhum uhi. Himahleh David bel Jerusalem ah a tam nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, nitak ninem in a lupna apan David a thoukhia a, kumpipa inn tung ah a kahtou hi. Inn tung apan numei khat kisil lai a mu hi. Huai numei bel melhoih tak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in mi a sawl a, huai numei tanchin a dong telsak hi. “Eliam tanu, Bathsheba, Hit mi Uriah zi ahi kei maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in thupawte a sawl a, a va pita uh. A kiang a hongtung a, a na luppihta hi. A sianlouhna apan siansak khit ahita hi, huchi in a inn ah paikikta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in numei a hong gaita a; “Nau ka paita” chi in David a thei sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David in Joab kiang ah, “Hit mi Uriah ka kiang ah honsawl in” chi’n a thukhak hi. Joab in David kiang ah Uriah a sawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uriah a kiang a tun in David in “Joab leh mite bang a chi ua, kidouna ah bang a chi ua?” chi in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in Uriah kiang ah, “Na inn ah pai inla, na khete vasil in” a chi hi. Huchi in Uriah kumpipa in apan a pawtkhia a, kumpipa’n an nekding thawnpiak a zuisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh Uriah a toupa sikha tengteng lak a kumpipa inn kongkhak bul ah a giak a; a inn ah a pai kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Uriah a inn ah a pai kei” chi a David a hilhtak un, David in Uriah kiang ah, “Khualzin hongtung hilou na hi maw? Bangdia na inn a pailou na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uriah in David kiang ah, “Pathian bawm, Israelte leh Judahte aidakbuk a om gige ua, ka toupa Joab leh ka toupa sikhate gamlak ah a kikulh uh. Kei ka inn a pai in ka ne in ka ta in, ka zi kiang ah ka lum ding maw? Na hinna leh na kha hinna lou in ka gen ahi, huai zaw ka hih kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David in Uriah kiang ah, “Tuni leng hiai ah omlai inla, zingchiah na paina ding” a chi hi. Huchi in Uriah huai ni leh a zingchiang leng Jerusalem ah a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in amah a sam a, a ma ah ne in a dawn hi. A dawn khamsak hi. Nitaklam in a inn a pailou in a toupa sikhate lak ah a giak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a zingchiang in David in Joab lai a khak a, Uriah a pawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai laikhak ah “Uriah gal khawkna pen ah ma phusak inla, a thah ua a sihna din kikhin san un” chi’n a gelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Joab in khua a umlai in, mi hangsante omna hi a a theih ah Uriah a pangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khua a mite a pawtkhia ua, Joab a sual ua, David sikhate khenkhat a si ua, Hit mi Uriah leng a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in Joab in mi a sawl a, kidou tungtang thil tengteng David a hilhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A mi sawl kiang ah, Kumpipa kiang a kidou tanchin tengteng na genkhit in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hong heh guih a, “Bangdia dou dia huchibang a khobul chin a hoh na hi ua? Kulh apan a honkap ding uh chih theilou na hi uh maw?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerubeseth tapa Abimelek that kua ahia? Buh gawizanna suang tungnungpen numei in kulh apan a tung ah a khesuk a, Thebez ah a si ahi kei maw? Bangdia hichibang a kulh kiang chin a pai na hi ua?” a chih leh, “Na sikha Hit mi Uriah leng si eive, na chi ding uh,” chi’n, thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in a mi sawl a kuanta a, a va tung a, Joab in a sawlsan tengteng David a hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A mi sawl in David kiang ah, “Mite’n a hon na zou ua, pawn ah honsual ua, kou a kholutna kongkhak tanpha in ka nawhkik uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thalkap mite’n kulh apan na sikhate a honkap ua, huchi in kumpipa sikha khenkhatte a si ua, na sikha Hit mi Uriah leng a si” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in David in misawl kiang ah, Joab kiang ah huchi in vagen in. “Hiaite’n na lungsim kipaklou sak kei hen. Namsau in kuamah a khentuam ngalkei a, naksem in khua sual unla hihsia un, chi in, hanthawn in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Uriah zi in a pasal Uriah a si chih a zak in a pasal a sun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A sun hun a bei nung in David in a inn ah a pi a, a zi a hong hita a, tapa khat a neihsak hi. Himahleh David thilhih in Toupa lungkimlou tak in a omsak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa’n David kiang ah Nathan a sawl hi. A kiang ah a va hoh a, hichi in a chi hi: “Khua khat ah mi nih a om ua; khat pen mi hausa ahi a, khat pen mi zawng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi hausa in belamhon tampi leh ganhon tampi a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi zawng in bel belamnou a nu neuchik khat lei a, a vulh kia lou ngal bangmah a neikei hi. Amah leh a tate toh khanglian khawm in a kuang sawk pih leh a nou kikoppih, a angsung a om, a tanu banggeih a a ngaihtuah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi hausa kiang ah khualzin mi khat a va tung hi. A kiang a mikhual tung amah belam leh gangoh phallou in mi zawngpa belamnou a gohsak zawta hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in huai mi tung ah David a heh mahmah a, Nathan kiang ah, “ Toupa hinna lou in ka gen hi, huai thilhih mi a sih ngeingei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hichibang thil a hih ziak leh hehpihna a neih louh ziak in a belamnou a mun li in adin ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nathan in David kiang ah, “Huai mipa Nangmah na hi. Toupa , Israelte Pathian in hichi in a chi: Israelte kumpipa din thau k’on nilh a, Saul khut apan k’on hunkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na pu in k’on luahsak a, na pu zite na angsung ah ka koih hi. Israel leh Judah inkawte ka honpia a; huaite a tawmluat uleh thildangte leng hon piakbeh lai ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangdia Toupa thupiak ngaineu a, a mitmuh a thil hoihlou na hih maizen? Hit mi Uriah namsau in na that a, a zi na zi din na neihsak a, Ammon suante namsau in amah na that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in, na inn apan namsau a paikhe kei ding. Kei hon ngaineu a, Hit mi Uriah zi na zi dia na lak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi. Ngai in, nangmah inkawte mah nang kalh ding thil hoihlou ka tungkhe dia, na mitmuh mahmah in na zite k’on laksak dia, na inveng ka pedia, aman hiai sun khovak in na zite a luppih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang a guk in na hih a, ken Israel mite tengteng mitmuh in sun khovak in ka hih ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in Nathan kiang ah, “ Toupa tung ah ka khialta” a chi hi. Nathan in David kiang ah, “ Toupa’n leng na khelhna a koihmangta. Na si kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh hiai na thilhih a Pathian gensiatna dia hunlemtang thupitak Toupa melmate na piak ziak in nang apan hong piangding naupang leng a si ngeingei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Nathan in a inn ah a paisanta hi. Uriah zi in David a suansak naupang tung ah Toupa’n a khutkha in, a chi a na mahmahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in, David in naupang adin Pathian kiang ah a ngen ngutngut a, an a ngawla, a lut a, zan khua in lei ah a lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A inkawte lak a upate a thou ua, lei apan kaithou din a kiang ah ading uh. Himahleh a thou nuam kei a, a kiang uah leng a ne sam kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a ni sagih ni’n naupang a sita hi. David sikhate’n naupang a sita chih a hilh ngamkei uh. “Ngai in, naupang a damlai in a kiang ah thu i gen ua, a ngaikhe nuam kei a. Naupang a sita chih bangchi’n i hilh ngam dia? Bangchi hiam in thil hoihlou a kihih kha ding” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh David in a sikhate kisimhou a muh in naupang a sita chih a theita hi. David in a sikhate kiang ah, “Naupang sita hia? a chi a, amau, “A sita” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in David lei apan a thou a, a kisil a, sathau a kinilh a, a puante a kheng a; Toupa inn ah a hoh a, Pathian a bia hi. A inn ah a pai nawn a, an a kan a, a ma ah a lui ua, a neta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in a sikhate’n a kiang ah, “Na thilhih bangchidan ahia? Naupang a damlai in an na ngawl a, na kap a, himahleh naupang a sihtak in na thou a, an na ne a” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman, “Naupang a damlai in anngawl in, ka kap hi. Naupang a damna din Toupa’n hon hehpih khamawh kei ding, kua ahia thei? Ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh tuin a sita ngal a, bang din an ka ngawl dia? Ka pi kiknawn thei dia hia? A kiang ah ka pai dia, himahleh amah ka kiang ah a hong kiknawn kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in David in a zi Bathsheba a lungmuan a, a kiang ah a lut a, a luppih a, tapa a suang a, a min Solomon a sa hi. Toupa’n amah a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in zawlnei Nathan a thukhak a, aman Toupa tamsak in a min Jedidiah a sata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in, Joab in Ammon suante khopi Rabah a sim a, khopi a lata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joab in David kiang ah mi a sawl a, “Rabah ka sim a, tuite khopi ka lata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuin mi omlai teng kaikhawm inla, khopi sualtum in zuan inla, la in. Ken khopi la leng ka min a pu kha ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in David in mi tengteng a kaikhawm a, Rabah ah a hoh ua, a vasim ua, a lata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A kumpipa uh lallukhu khuklai a laksak a, a gikdan dangkaeng talent khat ahi a, suangmantamte leng a tel hi. David a khusak ua, khopi ah gallak tampi a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in asung a om mipite a pikheta a, singatnate, leilehna sikzumte leh sik heipite zang in na a semsak hi. Lei haltakte a bawlsak a; Ammon suante khopi tengteng ah huchibang in a hih hi. Huchi in David leh mi tengteng Jerusalem ah a pai kiknawnta uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai nung in hichi ahi a, David tapa Absalom in sanggam numei melhoih khat a nei a, a min Tamar ahi. David tapa Amnon in amah a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Amnon a sanggamnu Tamar ziak in a buai mahmah a; a chi a na hi. Amah lah nungak siangthou a hih ziak in a tung a thil banghiam hih haksapi ahi chi’n Amnon in a ngaihtuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh Amnon in lawm a nei a, a min Jonadab ahi. Amah David unaupa Shimea tapa ahi. Jonadab gitlouhpil mahmah mi khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman Amnon kiang ah, “Aw, nang kumpipa tapa bangchidan ahia, a niteng a na gawn hulhul mawk? Hon hilhlou ding maw?” a chi hi. Amnon in a kiang ah, “Ka unaupa Absalom sanggamnu Tamar ka it a ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jonadab in a kiang ah, “Na lupna ah lumlum inla, ki chinasak in. Na pa’n a hongveh chiang in a kiang ah, Hehpih in ka sanggamnu Tamar ka kiang ah honghoh henla, tanghou nekding hongpia hen. Ka muhtheih in ka mitmuh mahmah in nekding hon bawlsak leh, a khutngei ah ka na ne ding, na chi in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Amnon a lum a, a ki chinasakta hi. Kumpipa’n amah a va et in Amnon in a kiang ah, “Hehpih in ka sanggamnu Tamar hongpai henla, ka mitmuh mahmah in tanghou pek nih hiam hon bawlsak henla, amah khut mahmah ah ka ne ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in David in Tamar kiang ah, “Na sanggampa Amnon inn ah hoh inla, nekding va bawlsak dihve” chi din a in ah mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in Tamar, a sanggampa Amnon inn ah a hoh hi. Amah a na lum hi. Tangbuang a la a, a mek a, a mitmuh a tanghou pek bawl in a kang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kanna bel a la a, a ma ah a bungkhia hi. Himahleh aman a ne nuam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amnon in, “Mi tengteng in hon pawt khiak san uhen” a chi hi. Huchi in a pawt khiak sanvek uhi. Amnon in Tamar kiang ah, “Na khut mahmah a ka nek theihna din nekding dantan ah honla in,” a chi hi. Tamar in a tanghou pek bawl a la a, a sanggampa Amnon kiang ah dantan ah a la lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nesak dia a kiang nai a a va paipih in a nalen a, a kiang ah, “Ka sanggamnu, ka kiang ah honglum in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman a dawng a, “Hilou e, ka sanggampa, honchi teitei ken. Israelte lak ah hichibang thilhih ding ahi kei. Hiai thil gilou haihuaitak hih ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ken ka maizumna koi ah ka paisak dia? Nang leng Israelte lak a mihaite lak a khat na hi ding. Huaiziak in, tuin kumpipa houpih zaw in, n’on neih a nial kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh a thu a zuikei a, amah sang in a hatzaw ngal a, thagum in a luppih teiteita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Amnon in huat chihtak in a hawta a, a huatna a itna sang in a lianzaw hi. Huchi in Amnon in a kiang ah, “Thou inla, paimang in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman a kiang ah, “Huchi ding ahi kei. Hichibang a dikloutak a n’on delhkhiak ka tung a na gamtatsa sang in a hoihkei zaw hi” a chi hi. Himahleh a zuinuam tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in a nasem sikha a sam a, “Hiai numei ka kiang apan pawtsak inla, kong khak bikbek in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puanaktual ze tuamtuam a gial a silh hi. Huchibang puanaktual kumpipa nungak siangthoute’n a silh uh ahi. Huchi in a sikha in a pikhia a, kong a khak bikbekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tamar in a lu ah meivu a koih a, a puanaktual silh ze tuamtuam a botkek a, a sip ah a khut a koih a, ngaihtak a kapkawm in a paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sanggampa Absalom inn a kiang ah, “Na sanggampa Amnon na kiang a om ahi maw? Himahleh tuin daimai in, ka sanggamnu, na sanggampa a ka, limsak dah in” a chi hi. Huchi in Tamar a sanggampa Absalom inn ah nguitak in a kikhumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh kumpipa David in huai tengteng a zak in a heh mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Absalom in Amnon kiang ah a sia a pha, bangmah a gen nuam kei hi. A sanggamnu Tamar a chih teitei ziak in Absalom in Amnon a haw mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum nih vengveng a beinung in hichi ahi a, Ephraim kiang a Baal hazar ah Absalom in belam mul a metsak hi. Hiai ah kumpipa tapa tengteng a chial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kumpipa kiang ah Absalom a hoh a, “Ngai in, na sikha in belam mul a metsak a, kumpipa leh a sikhate na sikha kiang ah hohle uh a keidia” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Absalom kiang ah, “Hilou e, ka tapa, ka vek un hohlou e, k’on hih tuailuai law kha ding uh” a chi hi. Huchi in aman chial teitei mah leh a ut tuankei a, himahleh a vualzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in Absalom in “Ahihkeileh ka unaupa Amnon bek ka kiang uah honghoh leh a ke” a chi hi. Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Bang din a honghoh tuamse dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himahleh Absalom in a ngen teitei a, huchi in Amnon leh kumpipa tapa tengteng a zuisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Absalom in, a sikhate kiang ah “Ngai un, Amnon uain dawn a nuam a saklai in na kiang ua Amnon that un, k’on chih leh, that unla, lau kei un, thu k’on pekhin hilou hia? Hangsantak in om unla, kipasal sak un” chi’n thu a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in Absalom sikhate’n Amnon tung ah Absalom thupiak bang in a hih uh. Huchi in kumpipa tapa tengteng a thou ua, a sabiltung uah a tuangchiat ua, a taimangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, lampi a a omlai un, Absalom in kumpipa tapate tengteng a thatvek a, khat lelleng a hawi kei hi, chi in David kiang ah thu a na tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa a thou a, a puansilhte a botkek a, lei ah a lumta hi. A sikha tengteng in leng a puansilhte uh botkek in a kiang ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David unau Shimea tapa Jonadab in a dawng a, “Ka toupa in kumpipa tapa tangval tengteng a thatvek uh chih gingta kei hen. Amnon kia ahi a si. A sanggamnu Tamar a chih teitei nungsiah Absalom in hichibang a hih a tup him ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huaiziak in tuin ka toupa, kumpipa’n kumpipa tapa tengteng a si uh chih gingta in lunghimawh kei hen. Amnon kia ahi a si” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Huai sung in Absalom a taimangta hi. Galvil tangval a dak a, a en a, ngai in, a nunglam a tangpang a lampi ah mi tampi a hongpai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jonadab in kumpipa kiang ah, “Ngai in, kumpipa tapate a hongpai uh, na sikha in a gen banggeih a na hina” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a genkhittak in ngai in, kumpipa tapate a hongtung ua, a aw uh suah in a kap uh. Kumpipa leng a sikhate toh kah petmah in a kapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Himahleh Absalom a taimang a, Geshur kumpipa Amihud tapa Talmai kiang ah a hoh hi. David in niteng in a tapa a sun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Absalom a taimang a, Geshur gam ah a hoh a, huai ah kum thum a va om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kumpipa David Absalom kiang a hoh a ut mahmah hi. Amnon tungtang thu ah a lung a muangta hi. Amah lah a sikhinta chih a theingal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in Zeruiah tapa Joab in kumpipa lungsim Absalom tung ah a om chih a na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Joab in Tekoa ah mi a sawl a, huai a numei pil khat a va pisak hi. A kiang ah, Lusun bang in kibawl inla, lusun puansilh inla, sathau leng kinilhlou in numei sawtpi misi sun bang in om in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa kiang ah hoh inla, a kiang ah hichibang in thu vagen in aw, a chi hi. Huchi in Joab in a kam ah thute a muam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tekoa khua a numei in kumpipa kiang a thugen di’n a mai a leisi in a khupboh a, zahtakna pia in, “toupa aw, honhuh in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Bangchidan ahia?” a chi hi. Aman a dawng a, “Meithai petmah ka hi a, ka pasal a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na sikha nu’n tapa nih a nei a, a nih un lou ah a kisual ua, kuamah phelh ding lah a omkei a, a khat pen in a dang a sat a, a thatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, a inkuan tengteng in na sikhanu a dou khawm ua, a unaupa thatpa, a unaupa a thah ziak a ka thah sam theihna ding un hon pekhia in, huchi in gouluah dingpa leng ka that pah ngal ding uh, a chi uh. Huchibang in ka mei am omlai a mitsak ding ua, ka pasal min neilou leh leitung a suan himhim neilou in a om mai ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa’n numei kiang ah, “Na inn ah pai inla, na tungtang thu ah thu ka pe mai ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tekoa khua a numei in kumpipa kiang ah, “Ka toupa, kumpipa aw, huai gitlouhna mawh ka tung leh ka pa inkawte tung ah ke mai hen. Kumpipa leh a mangtutphah in mawhpaw kei hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Kuapeuh na tung a banghiam gen peuhmah ka kiang ah honpi inla, a hon khoih nawn hetkei ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman, “Sisan suahmite tung a phulamite’n hihmang nawnlou ding in kumpipa’n Toupa na Pathian theigige hen aw, huchilou in zaw ka tapa a hihmang kha ding uh, a chi hi. Aman, “ Toupa hinna lou in ka gen ahi, na tapa samzang khat lel leng lei ah a ke kei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in numei in, “Na sikhanu in toupa ka pu kiang ah thu kam khat kia k’on gen nawn peuhmah ding aw” a chi hi. Aman, “Gen ve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Numei in, “Ahihleh bang ziak in ahia Pathian mite dou a hichibang a hihtum na hia? Hiai thu apan kumpipa mawh in a kilang ahi, kumpipa’n a delhmangpa a pi kiknawnlouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka si ngeingei ding ua, lei a bawsa luahnawn theihlouh tuisik bang ka hi uh. Pathian in hinna a lamang kei a, a delhmangpa amah apan hawlkhiak ahihlouhna ding lunggel ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in toupa ka pu kiang a hiai thu gendia ka hongleng mite’n a hon lauhsak ziak uh ahi. Na sikhanu’n, kumpipa kiang ah ka genphot dia, kumpipa’n a sikhanu nget a hihsak khakleh, ka chi a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa’n kei leh ka tapa Pathian gouluahlou dia hihman tummi lak a na sikhanu hunkhe din a na ngaikhe ding, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in na sikhanu adin, toupa, ka pu thu lungmuanhuaitak hi henla; a sia a pha na khen din toupa ka pu lah Pathian angel bang mai ahi ngal a. Toupa Pathian na kiang ah om hen, ka chi ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a dawng a, numei kiang ah, “Kondot peuhmah bangmah hon im ken aw” a chi hi. Numei in, “Toupa ka pu in gen leh a ke” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Hiai thu himhim ah Joab in panna a nei hia?” a chi hi. Numei in a dawng a, “toupa, ka pu, na kha hinna lou in ka gen ahi, toupa ka pu in a gensa kuamah in taklam hiam, veilam ah hiam a pel theikei ding uh. Na sikha Joab in honsawl a, hiai thu tengteng na sikhanu a honmuam vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil omdan hih lamdang din hiai thil na sikha Joab in a hih ahi. Ka pu bel khovel a thil om tengteng theithei in Pathian angel bang a pil ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Joab kiang ah, “Ngai in, ka hihsamta hi. Huaiziak in, pai inla, tangval Absalom vapi nawn lechin maw” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joab in a mai a leisi in a khupboh a, kumpipa kiang ah kipahthu a gen hi. Joab in, “toupa ka kumpipa aw, toupa’n a sikha ngetna a lohchin sak ziak in tuni in na sikha in na mit ka tung chih ka na theita hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in Joab a thou a, Geshur ah a hoh a, Absalom Jerusalem ah a honpita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “A ma inn ah pai henla, ka mel hong mu kei hen,” a chi hi. Huchi in Absalom a ma inn ah a pai a, kumpipa mel a muta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel tengteng lak ah Absalom bang a melhoih a phatloh kuamah a omkei uh. A khe lek apan a lusip pha in gensiatna himhim a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A sam a met chiang in, kum kivei teng in a metsak a, a sam lah a gik ziak in a metzel hi, a bukzel a, kumpipa bukna sekel za nih a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Absalom in tapa thum leh tanu khat a nei a, a min Tamar ahi a, melhoih tak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Absalom kum nih hilhial Jerusalem ah a om a; himahleh kumpipa mel himhim a mu kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Absalom in kumpipa kiang a amah sawl din Joab a thukhak hi. Himahleh a hoh nuam kei a, a thukhak nawn in leng a hohnuam tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in a sikhate kiang ah, “I aw, Joab lou, kei lou kiang ahi a, barli buh a nei a, va hal un” a chi hi. Huchi in Absalom sikhate’n lou a va halta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in Joab a thou a, Absalom kiang ah a inn ah a hoh a, “Bangdia na sikhate’n ka lou hal ahi ua?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Absalom in Joab a dawng a, “Ngai dih, Bangdia Geshur apan hongpai ka hia? Huai ah omden leng kei adia hoihzaw mah ding hiven. Kumpipa kiang a sawl dia hon thukhak ka hi. Huaiziak in tuin kumpipa mel hon musak in. Tatlekna nei ka hihleh honthat mai leh a ke” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Joab kumpipa kiang ah a hoh a, a hilh hi. Aman Absalom a sam a, kumpipa kiang ah a hoh a, kumpipa ma ah a mai a leisi in a khupboh a; huchi in kumpipa’n Absalom a tawp hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaikhit in hichi ahi a, Absalom in kangtalai leh sakolte leh mi sawmnga a ma a tai din a bawlkhol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Absalom zingkhang in a thou a, kulh kongkhak lampi nawl ah a na ding hi. Thubuai a na khensak dia kumpipa kiang a hongpai peuhmah a na sam a, “Kua khua na hia?” a na chizel hi. Amau, “Na sikha Israel namte lak a khat ka hi” a chizel uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Absalom in, “I aw, na thu a hoih in a dik hi. Himahleh a ngaikhe ding mi kumpipa’n kuamah a sepkei” a na chizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Absalom mah in, “Michih thubuai gen ding nei hiam, nget ding nei hiam peuhmah ka kiang ah hongpaina ding un, gam vaihawmpa in bawl in om leng china tel ing e aw! Huchi in diktak in vai ka na hawmsak ding” a na chi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hichi leng ahilai a, kuapeuh amah zahtakna pedia hong paitou peuhmah a khut in a na sawka, a na len a, a na tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mi kumpipa kiang a thugen dia hong kuan peuhmahte Absalom in huchibang in a na hihzel hi. Huchi in Absalom in Israel mite lungtang a guksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, kum li a hong bei in Absalom in kumpipa kiang ah, Hebron khua a Toupa kiang a ka thuchiam tangtun din hon hohsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na sikha in Suria gam a Geshur a ka omlai in Jerusalem a a hon pikik peuhmah leh Toupa na ka sem ding, chi in thu kachiam khinta, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Khamuangtak in kuan in” a chi hi. Huchi in a thou a, Hebron ah a hohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh Absalom in, “Pengkul ging na zak peuhmah chiang un, Hebron ah Absalom kumpipa ahita, na chi ding uh” chi in Israel nam tengteng kiang ah mi a simsawl khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem apan a sap mi za nih in Absalom a zui uh. Amau bel lungsim siangtak pu in a hoh ua, thil omdan bangmah a theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Absalom in kithoihnate a latlai in Gilon mi Ahitophel, David thudotmi, a Giloh khua apan a thukhak hi. A thusawm guk uh a thupi mahmah a; Absalom lam ah lah mipite a pung hulhul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David kiang ah, Israel mite lungtang Absalom lam ah a awn mahmah, chih thupuatu khat in a honghilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David in Jerusalem a om, a sikha tengteng kiang ah, “Thou unla i taikhe ding uh. Kuamah lah Absalom apan suakta lou ding i hi ngal ua. Pawtkhe meng un. Huchilou in zaw a hon phapah mai dia, i tung uah thil hoihlou tak a hontun dia, namsau in khua a hongsual kha ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa sikhate’n kumpipa kiang ah, “Ngai in, na sikhate ka toupa, ka kumpipa un a seh peuhmah hihdia mansa ka hi gige uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa a pawt a, a inkaw tengteng in a zui uhi. Kumpipa’n inn ngak din numei sawm, a meite a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa a pawt a, mi tengteng in a zui uh. Gamla kuam mun khat, inn tawpna ah a khawl tadih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sikha tengteng in a paikheng ua; Keritmite, Peletmite, Gitmite, mi za guk Gath apan amah honzuite kumpipa ma ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in, kumpipa’n Gitmi Ittai kiang ah, “Bangchidan ahia nang na hongtel? Pai kiknawn inla, kumpipa kiang ah om in. Nang zaw mikhual gamdangmi leng na hi ngal a, nangmah mun lam ah kiknawn mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zan zeka hong na hi a, tuni a ka kiang ua asuk atou a honzui sam din k’on chi ding maw? Ka pai theihtheihna a pai ding ka hi, nang zaw kiknawn inla, na unaute tengteng pi kiknawn in. Hehpihna leh thutak na kiang ah om hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ittai in kumpipa kiang ah, “ Toupa hinna leh kumpipa, ka toupa hinna lou in ka chi ahi. Kumpipa, ka toupa na omna na ah, sih leh sih ahi dia, dam leh dam ahi dia, na sikha a omsam ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in Ittai kiang ah, “Pai inla, pai zel aw leh” a chi hi. Huchi in Gitmi Ittai, a mite tengteng leh a tu a ta tengteng toh a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngaihtak in huai gam miteng a kap ua, mipite a paivek uh. Gamdai lampi zuan in a pai ua, kumpipa’n leng Kidron lui a kan a, mipi tengteng in leng a kan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zadok Pathian thukhun bawm zawng in Levite tengteng toh a kiang ah a pai uhi. Pathian bawm a nga ua, mipi in khua a pawt khiak sanvek tan in Abiathar a hohtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Zadok kiang ah, “Pathian bawm pen khopi sung ah zawnglut nawn un. Toupa mittung a ka om leh a hon pikik nawndia, Pathian bawm leh a omna a hon musak nawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Himahleh, nang ah kipahna mahmah ka neikei, a chih leh ngai in, hichimai ka hi a, hoih a sak bangbang in ka tung ah hihmai hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa’n siampu Zadok kiang ah, “Mutheipa na hi ka hia? Na tapate nih, na tapa Ahimaaz leh Abiathar tapa Jonathan toh lungmuangtakin khopi ah pai nawn un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ngai in, kei zaw tanchin a hong theihsak masiah uh gamdai a luikannate ah ka na om ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zadok leh Abiathar in Pathian bawm Jerusalem ah a paipih nawn ua; huai ah a omta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />David Olive tang paitouhna ah a kahtou a, a paitouh kawm in a kap kawmkawm hi. A lu a khuh a, khevuak in a pai hi. A kiang a mi om tengteng in a lu uh a khuhchiat ua, kap kawmkawm in a paitou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kua hiam khat in Ahitophel Absalom lam a pangin thusawmmite lak ah a pangsam, chih David a hilh hi. David in “ Toupa aw, Ahitophel lemtheihna haina suaksak din ka hon ngen hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, David Pathian biakna tangvum a kahkhiak touh leh ngai in, Arka mi Hushai a puanak bohkek silh a, a lu a leikai niaunuau in amah dawn din a hongpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />David in a kiang ah, “Ka kiang a na hongsam leh zaw, kei adin puakgik na hi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Himahleh khopi a na kiknawn a, Absalom kiang a, toupa aw, na sikha in ka om ding. Tuma lam a na pa sikha a ka om bang in, tuin na sikha in ka om leuleu ding, na vachih leh Ahitophel lemtheihna hon dalsakpa na hi zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huai ah na kiang ah siampu Zadok leh Abiathar leng a omsam uh ahi kei maw? Hichi ahi ding a, kumpipa inn a thupawt na zak peuhmah siampu Zadok leh Abiathar na hilh zel ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ngai in, a tapate uh nih Zadok tapa Ahimaaz leh Abiathar tapa Jonathan leng a kiang uah a om uhi. Na thil zak peuhmahte hon theisak din amau na honsawl zel ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchi in David lawm Hushai khopi ah a lut a; Absalom Jerusalem ah a lutta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, David in tangvum kahkhiakna a khenzek nung in, ngai in, Mephibosheth sikha Jiba in sabiltung nih toh a na dawn hi. Sabiltung nihte’n tanghou beu za nih, grep phoukeu bawk za khat, nipi thei za khat leh uain thawl khat a pua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Jiba kiang ah, “Hiaite bangchidan ahia?” a chi hi. Jiba in, “Sabiltungte kumpipa inkuanpihte tuanna ding ahi. Tanghou leh nipi theite tangvalte nekding; Uain bel gamdai a bah peuhmahte dawn ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Ahihleh na pu tapa koi ah?” a chi hi. Jiba in kumpipa kiang ah, “Ngai in, Jerusalem ah a om. ‘Tuni’n Israel inkawte’n ka pa lalgam a honpe kiknawn ding uh’ ” chi a a ngaihtuah ziak in, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Jiba kiang ah, “Ngai in, Mephibosheth thilneih tengteng nang a ahivekta” a chi hi. Jiba in, “Ka toupa, kumpipa aw, na mitmuh a hehpihna mu din kingainiamtakin k’on ngen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa David Bahurim a tun in ngai in, Saul inkawte lak a mi Gera tapa, a min Shimei a hong pawtkhia a; hamsia loukawm kawm in a hong paitou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Suang in David a deng a, kumpipa David sikha tengteng leng; Mi tengteng leh sepaih hat tengteng a taklam leh veilam ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Shimei in hamsiat in hichi in a chi: “Paimang vengveng in, pai mang vengveng in, nang sisan suahhat leh Belial mipa:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sik a vai na hawm Saul inkawte tengteng sisan Toupa’n na tung ah a hon kiksak nawnta. Toupa’n gam na tapa Absalom a na pekhinta. Ngai in, sisan suahhatmi na hih ziak in nangmah siatna na kitun ve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in Zeruiah tapa Abisai in kumpipa kiang ah, “Bangdia hiai ui sisa in toupa, ka pu hamsiat mawkmawk ahia? Ka kuantou ding a a lu ka tansak mai ding?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Nou Zeruiah tapate aw, nou n’on theihsak ding uh bang a om a? Toupa’n a kiang a, David hamsiat in, a chih leh a hamsiat ahi mai kei dia. Bangdia huchibanga hih kuan a chi dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in Abisai leh a sikhate tengteng kiang ah, “Ngai un, ka tapa, ka gil a gah mahmah in honthah a tum hi. Hiai Benjamin mi’n naktup sem nan chia! Bangmah loh kei unla, hamsia ahihleh loh hen. Toupa hihsak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n ka haksatna a honmu dia, Toupa’n tuni a hon hamsiat a hoihlam in a honthuk nawn kha maithei hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in David leh a mite lampi ah a pai zel uh. Shimei bel a gal tangpang ah a pai zel a, a paikawm in a hamsiat zel a, suang in a deng a, leivui in a theh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa leh a kiang a mi om tengteng Aiphim a tungta uh. Huchi in huai ah a khawl tawldam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Absalom leh Israel mi tengteng Jerusalem ah a hoh ua, a lak uah Ahitophel leng a tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Arka mi Hushai, David lawm, Absalom kiang a tunin Absalom kiang ah, “Pathian in kumpipa humbit hen, Pathian in kumpipa humbit hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Absalom in Hushai kiang ah, “Hichibang ahi maw na lawm na hehpihna dan? Bangdia na lawm kiang a hoh lou?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hushai in Absalom kiang ah, “Ka hohkei ding. Toupa leh hiai mite leh Israel mi tengteng a telpa uh thuthu in ka om dia, a kiang ah ka omzaw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kua na ka sem dia? A tapa ma ah na ka sem ding ahi kei maw? Na pa ma a ka sep bang in nangmah ma ah ka sem ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Absalom in Ahitophel kiang ah, “Bangchi’n i hih diam aw, na ngaihdan gen dihve” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahitophel in Absalom kiang ah, “Na pa mei, inn ngak a a koihte luppih in. Israel mi tengteng in na pa’n nang a hon mudah chih a naza ding ua; nang lam a pang tengteng khut a hat ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Absalom adin inn tung ah puanin a kai uh. Huchi in Israel mi tengteng mitmuh in pa meite a luppih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huailai in Ahitophel lemtheihnate, Pathian thu dongpa lemtheihna bang ahi a; huchi mah bang in David leh Absalom in leng Ahitophel a na ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huailou leng Ahitophel in Absalom kiang ah, “Mi sing khat leh sang nih ka telkhe dia, tuzan in David delh din ka kuan ding
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A bahlai leh hatlouh laitak ka vapha n’on dia, ka va lausak ding. Huchi in a kiang a mi tengteng a taimang ding uh. Huchi in kumpipa kia ka vathat mai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mipite na kiang ah k’on pikik nawn vekding. Na mi zonpa mi tengteng hongkik toh kibang ahi. Huchi in mi tengteng khamuang in a om ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan, hiai thugen in Absalom leh Israel upate a kipaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Absalom in, “Arka mi Hushai sam peuhmah phot inla, amah gendan i ngaikhe peuhmah ding uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hushai Absalom kiang a hongtun in Absalom in, “Ahitophel in hichibang in a gen a, a genbang a hih ding i ding uam? Hihlou ding hileng nang hon gen himhim dih” chi in a na houpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hushai in Absalom kiang, “Tutunga Ahitophel lemtheihna a hoih kei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hushai in, “Na pa leh a mite na thei a, sepaih hangsantak, gam a vompi a nou laksak bang mai ahi uh. Na pa lah galdou mi ahi a, mipi lak ah a giak kholkei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Ngai in, tuin leng koilai leihawm hiam ah, koilai mun ah hiam a kibu ahi ding. Hichi ahi ding a, a kisual tung ua mi khenkhat a puk ua leh a za peuh in, Absalom zuite a that ek uh, a chimai ding uh’.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in mi hangsantak, humpinelkai lungsim bangpu mi hial leng a hong lungke mahmah ding uh. Israel mi tengteng in lah na pa sepaih hangsantak ahihdan leh a kiang a mi omte mi hangsan taktak ahihdan uh a thei vek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Kei hoihsak sam dan, Israel mi tengteng Dan apan Beer–sheba pha in tuipi a piaunel zah hial ding na kiang ah samkhawm vek lehang; kidouna ah nang nangawn kuan lechin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in koilai mun peuh ah i kituahna na ah lei a daitui kia bang mai in i boh ding ua; amah leh a kiang a mi om tengteng khat lel leng i hawikei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huailou leng, khua a a lut leh Israel mi tengteng, khauhual tawi in huai khua ah i vahoh ding ua, suang neuchik leng omlou hial khop in lui ah i kaikhe vek ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Absalom leh Israel mi tengteng in, “Arka mi Hushai hoih sak Ahitophel hoihsak sang in a hoihzaw” a chi uhi. Toupa’n Absalom tung a thil hoihlou a tunsak theihna din Ahitophel hoihsak hoihtak letkhe din a na sepkhin him ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Hushai in siampu Zadok leh Abiathar kiang ah, “Huchibang khachibang in Ahitophel in Absalom leh Israel upate hoih din a ngaihtuah pih a; ken huchibang khachibang in hoih din ka ngaihtuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in, tuzan in gamdai lui kainate a giak nawnlou in kan ngeingei un. Huchilou in zaw kumpipa leh a kiang a om tengteng a hihmang vek kha ding uh chi’n David hilhsak zok un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khopi sung a lut uh kuama’n a muhlouhna ding un, Jonathan leh Ahimaaz bel En-rogel ah a om ua; sikhanu khat in amaute a va hilhzel hi. Amau kumpipa David a va hilh sawnzel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh naupang in a na mu a, Absalom a hilh hi. Himahleh a nih un a taimang pah ua, Bahurim a mi khat, a intual a tuileh nei in ah a va hoh ua, tuileh sung ah a lutsukta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Numei in tuileh a sitna in a sin a, a tung ah buh a phou a, kuama’n a theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Absalom sikhate numei kiang ah a vahoh ua; Ahimaaz leh Jonathan kaw om ahi ua? a chi uh. Numei in a kiang uah, Lui a kanta ding uh, a na chi hi. A va zong ua, a mu kei ua, Jerusalem ah a kiknawn uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, a paitum khit un tuileh apan a hong pawtkhia ua, kumpipa David a va hilh uhi. David kiang ah, “Pawtkhia unla, luikan pah un, huchi in Ahitophel in a hontum hi” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in David leh a kiang a mi om tengteng a pawtkhia ua, Jordan lui a kan uh. Khua a hongvak in Jordan lui kanlou khat lel leng a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahitophel in a hoihsak dan a zuikei uh, chih a theih in a sabiltung a van a, a pawtkhia a, a khua ah a pai hi. A inkuante khosakna ding a bawlsak sipsip a, huchi in a awklumta hi. Amah a sita a, a pa han ah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in David Mahanaim a vatung hi. Absalom in a kiang a Israel mi tengteng toh Jordan lui a kan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Absalom in Joab sik in Amasa sepaih heutu din a koih hi. Amasa bel, mi khat a min Ithra tapa ahi. Ithra bel Israel mi, Joab nu sanggam Nahash tanu Abigail zi a neipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel mite leh Absalom in Gilead gam ah panmun a khoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, David Mahanaim a tun in, Ammon suan Rabah khua a mi Nahash tapa Shobi, Lo Debar khua a mi Amiel tapa Makir, leh Rogelim khua a Gilead mi Barjilaite’n
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lupnate, maiphiatkuangte, leibelte, huitbuh, barli buh, tangbuang, be kankeu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khuaizu, mokhon, belamte, bawng nawikhalte, David leh a kiang a om mite nekding a hontawi uhi. “Gamdai ah mite a gilkial ua, a tawl ua, a dangtak uhi” a chih ziak un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, David in a kiang a om mite a sim a, sepaih sang tung a heutute, za tung a heutute a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in mite a sawlkhia a, mun thum a khen, mun khat Joab in a heu a, mun thum a khen mun khat Joab unaupa Zeruiah tapa, Abisai in a heu a, mun thum a khen, mun khat Gitmi Ittai in a heu hi. Kumpipa’n mite kiang ah, “Keimah leng nou toh ka kuan ngeingei ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh mipite’n, “Kuan lou e. Koute zaw na taimang hita le ung leng, khawk a sa kei ding uh. A kimkhat hiam vasi le ung leng khawk a sa kei lai ding uh. Nang koute sing khat sang in na manpha zaw hi. Huaiziak in khopi apan hon panpih dia nana om a hoihzaw hi” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang uah, “Hoih nasak bangbang un ka hih ding” a chi hi. Huchi in kumpipa kulh kongpi bul ah ading a, mipi tengteng a zaza in leh a sangsang in a paikhe zungzung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Joab, Abisai leh Ittai kiang ah, kei ziak in tangval Absalom tung ah nemtak in hih un, chi in thu a pia hi. Mipi tengteng in Absalom tungtang thu a kumpipa’n sepaih heutute tengteng thu a piaklai a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in mipite Israel mite dou din kidouna mun ah a hohta ua; a kidouna uh Ephraim gammang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai ah David mite ma ah Israel mite a vuallel ua, huai ni’n sepaih sing nih a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kidouna un huai gam tengteng a uapvek ngal a. Huai ni’n namsau sang in leng gammang sung a mang a si a tamzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Absalom in David mite a bingtuah guih hi. Absalom a sabiltung tung a tuang ahi a, sabiltung tawsaw singhiang bawkpha tak nuai ah a lut a, a lu tawsaw sing ah a awkta hi. Lei phalou, van phalou in a luai nilouh hi. Sabiltung a taisuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kuahiam in mu in, Joab a hilh a, “Ngai in, tawsaw sing ah Absalom kikhai nilouh ka mu,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joab in a hilhpa kiang ah, “Ngai in, huai lah na mu ngal a, bangdia hih lum a lei a kesak pah ngallou? Huchibang a hih hile chin dangka sawm leh kawnggak hon pepah ding hi veng in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai mi’n Joab kiang ah, “Dangka sang mu ding hileng le kumpipa tapa tung ah ka khut ka kha kei himhim ding, i bil ua i zak mahmah in kumpipa’n nang leh Abisai leh Ittai kiang ah, Tangval Absalom kuamah in khoih hetkei un, chi in thu a honpe ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ginom huailou tak in na that mawk leng, kumpipa lak ah lah bangmah sel theih ahi ngalkei a, nang lah na kihulsak nawn maimah tuak ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Joab in, “Hichibang in na kiang ah ka om nilouh thei hetkei” a chi hi. Teipi thum a tawi a, tawsaw sing lak a na hinglai Absalom lungtang a dawt pailet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joab galvantawi tangval sawmin a hongum ua, Absalom a sun ua, a thatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joab in pengkul a mut a, Israelte delh mipite a hong kiknawn ua; Joab in mite a na nang bikbek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Absalom luang a la ua, gammang ah leihawm thukpi ah a pai ua, a tung ah suang a sekhawm venvon uhi. Huchi in Israel mi tengteng amau puanin chiat ah a taikekta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Absalom in a damlai in kumpipa guam ah amah theihgigena ding suang a na phutkhin hi. Ka min a dailouhna ding tapa lah ka nei ngal kei a, chi in amah min a tamsak hi. Huchi in tunitan in hiai Absalom theihgigena suangphuh chih in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in Zadok tapa Ahimaaz in, “Ka vatai dia, Toupa’n a melma phu a laksak dan tanchin kumpipa ka vahilh ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joab in a kiang ah, “Tuni’n zaw tanchin vahilh nai ken. Nidang chiang in tanchin va hilhzaw in, kumpipa tapa a sih ziak in, tuni’n zaw tanchin bangmah va hilhdah in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joab in Kush mi kiang ah, “Kuan inla, na thilmuh kumpipa va hilh dihve” a chi hi. Huchi in Kush mi a kun a, a taikhe pah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zadok tapa Ahimaaz in Joab kiang ah, “A koi a bang hileh, Kush mipa ka vadelh ding” a chi hi. Joab in, “Ka tapa aw, tanchin hilhman lah na mu kei dia, bangdia tai ding na hia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh aman, “A koi a bang hileh ka tai ding” a chi hi. Aman a kiang ah, “Tai maive leh” a chi hi. Huchi in Ahimaaz phaizang lampi ah a tai a, Kush mipa a makhelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />David kulh kongpi chial kikal ah a na tu hi. Galvilpa kulh kongpi pawnung zaw pen tunglam ah a paitou a, a dak vialvial hi. Ngai in, mi khat amah kia in a hongtai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galvilpa a kikou a, kumpipa a hilh hi. Kumpipa’n, “Mi khat kia ahihleh tanchin hong gen ding nei ahi ding” a chi a; a hongpai mengmeng a, a hongnai hiaihiai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Galvilpa’n midang hongtai a mu nawn hi. Galvilpa’n kongkhak vilpa a sam a, “Ngai in, midang amah kia in a hongtai nawn” a chi hi. Kumpipa’n “Aman leng tanchin hongtun sam ding ei ve’ a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Galvilpa’n, “A masapen taidan Zadok tapa Ahimaaz taidan bang mahmah in ka thei” a chi hi. Huan, kumpipa’n, “Amah mi hoih mahmah ahi, tanchinhoih hontun ding ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahimaaz in a sam a, kumpipa kiang ah, “Bangkim a hoih e” a chi hi. A mai a leisi in kumpipa ma a kun in, “ Toupa , ka toupa sual a khutkhak tummite daltanpa Toupa na Pathian phat in om hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Tangval Absalom a dam na maw?” a chi hi. Ahimaaz in a dawng a, “Joab in kumpipa sikha, kei na sikha mahmah a honsawl khiaklai in a buai nuainuai uh ka mu a, himahleh bang ahia chih ka theikei” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kumpipa’n, “Ka pam ah hong dingta dih in” a chi hi. Huchi in a pam ah a na ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngai in, Kush mi a hongtung hi. Kush min, “toupa ka kumpipa adin tanchin ka hontun hi. Na tung a helte tengteng phu tuni’n Toupa’n a hon laksak hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Kush mi kiang ah, “Tangval Absalom a dam na maw?” a chi hi. Kush mi in a dawng a, “toupa, ka kumpipa melmate leh na siatna zongmite tengteng huai tangval bang in omvek uheh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa a lungdong mahmah a, kulh kongpi tung a dantan ah a hohtou a a vakap hi. A paitouh kawm in, “Aw, ka tapa Absalom, ka tapa Absalom, na sihsik in sizaw mai leng maw, Aw Absalom, ka tapa, ka tapa” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Joab a hilh ua, “Ngai in, kumpipa’n kap in Absalom a sun hi” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai ni a a vualzohna uh mi tengteng adin sunna a honghi zawta hi. “A tapa ziak in kumpipa a lungkham mahmah” a chih uh huai ni’n mite’n lah a na zata ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mite kidouna a mi taimang a zum ziak a a guk a paimang bang in huai ni’n a guk in khopi ah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a mai a hum a, “Aw, ka tapa Absalom, aw Absalom, Ka tapa, ka tapa!” chi in kumpipa a kap huphup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joab inn ah kumpipa kiang ah a lut a, “Na hinna, na tapate hinna, na tanute hinna, na zite leh na meite hinna humbit mite tuni in zumtak in na bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang honhawte na it a, nang hon itte na hua hi. Heutute leh sepaihte nang adia bangmah hilou bang in tuni in na hihlangta hi. Absalom dam in, kou midang tengteng tuni in sizaw vek le ung, na kipahlam tak hi leh kilawm in ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaiziak in, thou inla, pawtkhia in. Na mite lungmuansak ding lamthu gen in. Na pawt khiak kei leh Toupa min lou in ka kichiam hi. Mi khat lel leng tu zan in na kiang ah a omkei ding. Huai lah nang adin na tuailai apan tutan a na tung a thil hoihlou hongtung teng sang in a hoih keizaw ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa a thou a, kulh kongpi ah a va tu hi. “Ngai un, kumpipa kulh kongpi ah a tu hi” chi in mipi tengteng a hilh uhi. Mipi tengteng kumpipa ma ah a va hoh uhi. Israelte bel amau puanin chiat ah a taikek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel nam a mi tengteng a kisel vengvung ua, “Kumpipa’n i melmate khut apan a hon hunkhia a, Philistiate khut apan a hon hondamta. Tuin Absalom ziak in gam a taikhiak san hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Absalom i kumpipa dia thau i nilhpa uh lah kidouna ah a sita a; Bang a chia kumpipa pikikna ding kamkhat bek na genlouh uh?” a kichi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa’n siampu Zadok leh Abiathar kiang ah a sawl a, Judah upate kiang ah, “Bangdia kumpipa a inn a pikik thu a, a zekai pen a pang na hi ua? Israel mite’n kumpipa pikik thu a gen ulah kumpipa kiang a tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka unaute na hi ua, ka guh leh ka sa lah na hi ngal ua, bang a chia a zekaipen a pang peuhmah na hi ua? chi in vagen un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amasa kiang ah, “Ka guh leh ka sa na hi ka hia? Joab sik a ka ma a sepaihte heutu a k’on bawl kei leh, Pathian in a lohloh honloh mai henla, huai sang a thupizaw in leng, a chi” chi din mi a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Judah mi tengteng lungtang mi khat lungtang bang mai in a awnsakta hi. Huchi in kumpipa kiang ah, “Na mi tengteng toh hong kiknawn un” chi din mi a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa a pai nawn a, Jordan a hongtung hi. Kumpipa dawn a, Jordan a na pi galkai din Gilgal ah Judahte a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hahurim a Benjamin mi Gera tapa Shimei leng kintak in kumpipa dawn din Judahte mah toh kiton in a pawtkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kiang ah Benjamin mi sang khat toh, Saul inkawte sikha Jiba, a tapa sawmlehnga leh a sikha sawmnih toh ahi ua, kumpipa ma in Jordan a galkahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa inkawte pi galkahna ding leh hoih a sak bangbang a hih din long a paipih uh. Jordan lui a galkah leh Gera tapa Shimei kumpipa ma ah a khupboh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa kiang ah, “Ka toupa’n thulimlouhna nei in hon sepkei henla; toupa ka kumpipa’n Jerusalem a pawtsan ni a na sikha in dikloutak a na hihte leng theigige sam kei hen. Kumpipa’n a lungtang ah paikei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na sikha in thil ka hihkhial chih ka kithei hi. Huaiziak in, ngai in, Joseph inkaw tengteng lak a ka toupa kumpipa mu dia tuni a hongpawt masapen ka hi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh Zeruiah tapa Abisai in a dawng a, “ Toupa thau nilhpa a hamsiat ziak in Shimei pen thah ding ahi kei dia hia? a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in, “Nou Zeruiah tapate aw, nou n’on na theihsak ding uh bang ahia om? Tuni a kei hondoute na hi ding u maw? Tuni a Israelte lak a mi thah ahi dia hia? Tuni’n Israel mite tung a kumpipa ka hih theilou ka hi maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huaiziak in, kumpipa’n Shimei kiang ah, “Na si kei ding” a chi hi. Huchi in Kumpipa a kiang ah a kichiamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saul tapa Mephibosheth kumpipa mu din a honghi. Kumpipa a pawt khiak ni apan galmuang a a hong painawnni tan in a khete a zunkei a, a khamul a tankei a, a puan leng a sawp sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, kumpipa mu dia Jerusalem a hongtun in kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Mephibosheth, Bangdia ka kiang a hongsam lou?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aman a dawng a, “Ka toupa, kumpipa aw, ka sikha in a hon zekhem a; na sikha in, kumpipa kiang a hoh din ka tuanna ding sabiltung ka van ding, ka chi a; na sikha lah a khe a bai ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa ka toupa kiang ah na sikha a hek hi. Himahleh toupa ka kumpipa Pathian angel ahi. Huaiziak in, hoih na sak bangbang in hih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka pa inkawte tengteng toupa ka kumpipa ma a thahvek dia kilawm ahi uhi. Himahleh na sikha na an umpihte lak ah na pangsak hi. Huaiziak in, kumpipa kiang ah thildang phut ngamlai dia kilawm ka hi maw?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang ah, “Na tungtang thu bangdia gennawn nak na hia? Nang leh Jiba gam kihawm un ka chi hi” a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mephibosheth in kumpipa kiang ah, “Eh, aman tangvek hen, toupa ka kumpipa lah amah inn mah ah galmuang in a hongpai nawnta ngal a” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gilead mi Barjilai Rogelim apan a hongsuk a; kumpipa Jordan a pi galkah din amah toh Jordan ah a hoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Barjilai upapi ahi a, kum sawmgiat a upa ahita. Mahanaim a kumpipa omsung in nekding a pia a, amah mi neizou tak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Barjilai kiang ah, “Ka kiang ah hong inla, ka kiang ah Jerusalem ah, k’onvak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Barjilai in kumpipa kiang ah, “Jerusalem a kumpipa toh hohtou din bangtan ka damlai dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuin kum sawmgiat ka hita a; a sia leh a pha ka khen thei ahia? Na sikha in ka nek leh dawn, a lim leh lim louh leng a theikak thei ahia? Pasal leh numeite lasak ging leng ka za thei nawn ahia? Huaiziak in, na sikha bangdin toupa ka kumpipa adia puakgik ka hih maizen ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na sikha in kumpipa toh Jordan galkah lel ka tup ahi. Bang din kumpipa’n huchibang in hoihman a honthuk chitchiat dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hehpih in na sikha hon paisak nawn mai in, k’on ngen hi. Ka nu leh ka pa han omna koumau khua ngei ah ka si ding. Himahleh en in, na sikha Chimham; toupa ka kumpipa toh hong galkah henla, a tung ah hoih nasak bangbang in hih in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a dawng a, “Chimham ka kiang ah a galkah sam dia, hoih na sak bangzel in a tung ah ka hih ding. Thil n’on nget peuhmah k’on hihsak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Huchi in mi tengteng Jordan gal a kah ua, kumpipa leng a galkah hi. Kumpipa’n Barjilai a tawp a, a vualzawl hi. Huchi in amah a mun ah a pai nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa Gilgal ah a galkah a, Chimham a kiang ah a galkah sam hi. Judami tengteng in kumpipa a pi galkah ua, Israel mi leng a kim khat a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ngai in, Israel mi tengteng kumpipa kiang ah a hong ua, kumpipa kiang ah, “Bang a chia ka unau uh Judah mite’n nang hon gukhia a, kumpipa leh a inkawte leh David mite teng Jordan gal a a pikhawm vekmawk uh?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Judah mi tengteng in Israel mite a dawng ua, “Kumpipa ka kinaihpih uh a hih ziak ahi. Bangdia hiai thu a heh mawk? Kumpipa neih muang a om ka hi mahmah u maw? Thilpiak banghiamte leng a honnei ahia?” a chi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel mite’n Judah mite a dawng ua, “Kumpipa ah tan sawm ka nei ua, David ah noute sang in anglaitanna ka neizaw uh. Bangdia hon ngaineu maw? Kumpipa pi kiknawn sawm masate ka hi kei uh maw? a chi uh. Huchi in Judah mite thu Israel mite thu sang in a khauhzaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Benjamin mi Bikri tapa Sheba, Belial mi khat a na om hi. Aman pengkul a mut a, “David ah tantuan i neikei ua, Jesse tapa ah leng gouluah ding i neisam kei, Israel mite aw, na puanin lam chiat uah pai un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Israel mi tengteng in David a zuih uh a lehngatsan ua, Bikri tapa Sheba a zuita uhi. Judah mite’n Jordan apan Jerusalem pha in a kumpipa uh a len chinten uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David Jerusalem a a inn ah a hongpai hi. Kumpipa’n numei sawm a meite inn ngak dia a koihte a pi a, inn khat ah a khum a, a nekding uh pia in a vak a, himahleh amau a luppih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Amasa kiang ah, “Ni thum sung in Judah mite honsap khawm sak inla, nang leng hong omsam in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amasa Judah mite samkhawm din a kuan hi. Himahleh a hunseh sak sang in a va tamsawt zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David in Abisai kiang ah, “Bikri tapa Sheba in Absalom sang in i poi uh a khoihzaw dia hia? Na toupa mite pi inla delh un. Huchilou in zaw khaw kulhnei ah a lut man dia, muh phaklouh in i khahsuah kha ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in, Joab mite, Kereth mite, Pelet mite leh a mi hat tengteng un amah a zuikheta uh. Jerusalem apan Bikri tapa Sheba delh din a pawtkhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibeon a suangpi omna a vatun un, Amasa in amaute a na dawn hi. Joab in kidouna van a silh a, a tung ah namsau a pai toh kawnggak ah a kuah hi. Mailam a a paikawm in huai namsau a phawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab in Amasa kiang ah, Unaupa, “Na hoih tadih na maw?” a chi hi. Huaikhit in Joab in Amasa tawp din a khut taklam in a khamul a man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh Amasa in Joab in a tawi namsau a limsak kei hi. Joab in a gil ah a dawt a, a gilzangte lei ah a tolhkhe zelzul a, a dawt tuan nawn kei hi. Huchi in a sita hi. Joab leh a unaupa Abisai in Bikri tapa Sheba a delh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kiang ah Joab mite lak a tangval khat ading a, “Joab lam a pang leh David lam a pang peuhmah in Joab zuihen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amasa bel lamlian laitak ah si a kidiah in a na lum hi. Huai mi’n mi tengteng ding didepa a muh in lamlian apan Amasa luang gamlak ah a suan a, a kiang a hongpai peuhmah khawlzela a muh ziak in puan in a tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lamlian apan suankhiak ahihnungin Bikri tapa Sheba delh din mi tengteng in Joab a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abel leh Bethmaka pha in Israel nam tengteng leh Ber mi tengteng a tawnvek a; amau a ki kaikhawm ua amah a zuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bethmaka a Abel khua ah amah a um ua; khaw zulzul ah lei a chiang ua, kulh zul ah ading uhi. Joab kiang a mi om tengteng in chimsak din kulh a khoh okok uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in numei pil khua apan a hong kikou a, “Ngai un, ngai un; Joab kiang ah, Hongpai nai in, na kiang ah thu ka gen ding, va chi un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kiang a vanaih tak in numei in, “Joab na hi hia?” a chi hi. Aman “Hi e,” chi’n a dawng hi. Huchi in a kiang ah, “Na sikhanu thugen ngaikhe dih,” a chi a, aman, “Ka ngaikhia hi,” chi’n a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai numei in, “Nidanglai in Abel khua ah a kikum ngeingei ding uh” a chizel uh. Huchibang in thu a tawpsak zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei Israel lak a kituah ut leh muanhuai mite lak a khat ka hi. Nang zaw Israel khua, a khaw bulpi pen hihsiat tum neilim ve. Bangdia Toupa gou nawmvalh tum na hia? a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joab in a dawng a, “Huchibang ahi zenzen kei. Nawmvalh hiam, hihsiat hiam ka tumkei himhim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchibang thu ahi kei hi. Ephraim tanggam a mi Bikri tapa a min Sheba in kumpipa kalh in, David hilhial kalh in a khut a lik hi. Amah hon pekhe le uchin khua ka pawtsan mai ding” a chi hi. Numei in Joab kiang ah, “Ngai in, a lutang kulh apan lawtkhiat ahi ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi in numei in a pilna in mi tengteng kiang ah a vapai a, Bikri tapa Sheba lutang a tan ua, Joab kiang ah a lawnkhia uhi. Huchi in pengkul a mut a, amau puanin chiat zuan in khua apan a paita uhi. Joab Jerusalem ah kumpipa kiang ah a paikikta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joab Israel sepaih tengteng heutu ahi a; Jehoiada tapa Benaiah ahihleh Kereth mi leh Pelet mite heutu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Adoram nasem dia goih teiteite heutu ahi a, Ahilud tapa Jehosaphat tanchin gelhmi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sheva Laigelhmi ahi a; Zadok leh Abiathar ahihleh siampute ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jair mi Ira leng David miliante heutu ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, David damlai in kum kizom in kum thum kial a kia hi. David in Toupa a dong a, Toupa’n “Saul leh sisan suahmi a inkawte ziak ahi. Amau Gibeon mite a that ngal ua” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Gibeon mite a sam a, a kiang uah, Gibeon mite Israel suante ahi kei ua, Amor mi omsunte ahizaw uh. Israel suante amau kiang ah a na kichiamkhin ua; Saul in Israel suante leh Judah suante adia phatuam a ngaih ziak in thah a tumnak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in Gibeon mite kiang ah, “Bang ahia k’on hihsak ding? Toupa gou na vualzawl theihna ding un bangchi bang in hihdik thak nawnna ka bawl dia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gibeon mite’n a kiang ah, “Saul leh a inkawte dangka leh dangkaeng ka lakei ding uh. Kou ziak in Israel ah mi kuamah na thatkei ding uh” a chi uhi. Aman, “Na gen peuhmah uh k’on hihsak ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau kumpipa kiang ah, “Hon hihmangpa leh Israel gamsung himhim a omlou dia hihmang hon sawmpa
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tapa sagihte honpia inla, Toupa miseh Saul omna Gibeah ah Toupa ma ah ka khailum ding uh” a chi uh. Kumpipa’n, “Honpe leng a ke” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh kumpipa’n, David leh Saul tapa Jonathan kikal a, a nih ua kal a Toupa kichiamna ziak in Saul tapa Jonathan tapa Mephibosheth a hawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Aiah tanu Rizpah in Saul tapa nih a neihsak Armoni leh Mephibosheth a pi a, Meholath mi Barjilai tapa Adriel, Saul tanu Mikal in tapa nga a neihsakte toh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gibeon mite khut ah a pekhia a, tang a Toupa ma ah a khailum uhi. Huchi in a sagih un a sikhawm uhi. Buhlak hun, barli buh lak patlai in a thatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aiah tanu Rizpah in saiip puan a la a, amah adin suangpi tung ah a phah hi. Buhlak kipattung apan huai siluangte tung a van vuahtui in a buahtan in, sun chia siluangte tung a vasate a tuk ding uh leh zan chia gamsate khoih ding a phalkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aiah tanu, Saul meinu Rizpah thilhih David a hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in David a kuan a, Philistia mite’n Gilboa a Saul a thah ni ua Philistia mite’n Bethsan mun lian a a khai uh a guhte uh, Jabesh-gilead mite’n a va guklak uh, Saul guh leh a tapa Jonathan guhte a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huai apan Saul guhte leh a tapa Jonathan guhte a latou a; a khailupte uh guhte leng a lakhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saul guhte leh a tapa Jonathan guhte Benjamin gam a Jelaha a pa Kish han ah a vui uh. Kumpipa thupiak dungzui in a hih uhi. Huaikhit in huai gam tung ah Pathian a lungkimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Philistia mite’n Israel mite a dou nawn uhi. David, a mite toh a va kuansuk ua; Philistia mite a vasual ua, David a bah mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ishbibenob, milian tapate lak a khat, a teipi gikdan dal sekel za thum, namsau thak kuah in David thah a tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh Zeruiah tapa Abisai in a hong hunkhia a, Philistia mi a sual a, a thatta hi. David mite’n, “Israelte khawnvak na mihsak louhna din kidou ding in ka kiang uah nang zaw na kuan nawn kei ding” chi’n a kiang ah a kichiam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, Gob ah Philistiate toh kidouna dang khat a om nawn hi. Huai hun in Hushat mi Sibbekai in milian suante lak a khat Saph kichi a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Philistia mite toh Gob khua ah a kidou nawn uh. Bethlehem mi Jaar oregim tapa Elhanan in Gitmi Goliath unaupa a that a, huai mi teipi siam kolpi bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gath khua ah kidouna a om nawn hi. Huai ah mi khat a san a sang, a khut langkhat tuaktuak a khutzung guk, a khe langkhat tuaktuak a khezung guk, avek a sawmnih leh li nei a om hi. Amah leng milian suan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman Israel mite a vatou a, David unau Shimea tapa Jonathan in a na that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huai lite Gath khua a milian suante ahi ua, huchi in David leh a mite khut in a sita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, David in a melma tengteng khut apan leh Saul khut apan Toupa’n a hutkhiak ni’n hiai la thu Toupa kiang ah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Aman, Toupa ka suangpi leh ka kulhpi leh hon humbitpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka suangpi Pathian, Amah ka muang ding a; ka phaw leh ka hotdamna ki, ka insang leh ka bukna ahi. Ka hondampa, hiamgamna apan n’on hondam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Phattak Toupa ka sam ding a; huchi in hondoute lak apan hotdam in ka om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sihna tuikihawt in hon umkimvel a, Pathian limsaklou mite tuilian in a hon lausak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Sheol khauhualte’n a hon gaksuak a; sihna thangte’n a hon awk sak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lungzin in Toupa ka sam a, ahi, ka Pathian ka sam hi: a biakin apan ka aw a za a, ka kikou husa a bil ah a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaitak in lei a ling a, a kisat hi. A heh ziak in van kingaknate nangawn kisat in a lingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nak apan meikhu a zam tou a, a kam apan pawt mei in a kang hi. Huai in meihol a kuangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Aman vante a kunsak a, a hongsuk ua; a khenuai ah mialna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cherub tung ah a tuang a, a lengta hi, huihkhua tung ah amah muh in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khomial in a ki umkimvel a, tui vomte, van meipi sah miuhmeuhte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ma a vakna tawn in meiholte a kuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa van apan a hong ging a, Tungnungpen in a aw a suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thaltangte a kapkhia a, amau a dalhzak sak a; khua a phesak a, a buaizak sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa salhna, a nakvangte a hu in tuipi lampite a hong kilang a, lei kingaknate hihlat in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Aman tunglam apan a hon sawksuk a, a honlen a; tuipi apan a hon kai kheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei hondou hattak apan hon humbit a, kei hon hawte apan leng; kei adin lah a hatlaw ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ka tuahsiat ni’n a honsual ua, himahleh Toupa ka kingakna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman mun awngthawltak ah a hon pikhia a; ka tung a a kipah ziak in a hon humbitta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa’n ka diktatna dungzui in ka tung ah a hih a; ka khutte sianthoudan dungzui in a honthuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa lampite ka zui a, ka Pathian apan gilou takin ka pai mang ngei ngalkei a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A vaihawmna tengteng ka ma a a om ziak in: a thusehte ka kilehheisan ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ma ah leng gensiat bei ka hilai a, ka thulimlouhna apan ka ki huikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa’n ka diktatdan bangzel in a hon na thukta a; a mitmuh a ka sianthoudan bangzel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chingtheite kiang ah chingthei in na kilang ding a, mi hoihkimte kiang ah hoihkim in na kilang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Misiangthoute kiang ah siangthou in na kilang ding a; mi genhakte kiang ah genhak in a kilang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Haksa thuak mite na hondam ding a; mi kisatheite na niamsak theihna ding in a tung uah na mit a tu gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka khawnvak na hi ngal a. Toupa’n ka mialna a vaksak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nang panpih in sepaihhon toh ka tai a, ka Pathian panpih mah in kulh ka tawmkan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian lampi a hoihkim a; Toupa thu etchetsa ahi; amah muangte tengteng adin Amah lum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Toupa lou kua Pathian a om a? I Pathian lou kua suangpi a om a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian ka hatna leh thilhihtheihna ahi a, Aman ka lampite a hoihkim in a bawl hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka khepekte zukpi khepek bang in a bawl a; Ka mun sangte ah a hon omsak zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka khutte galdou ding in a sinsak a; huchi in ka bante’n dal thalpeu a tansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nang na hotdamna lum n’on pia a; na nunnemna in n’on bawl lianta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka nuai a ka kalsuante na liansak a, huchi in ka khete a tolh kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hondoute ka delhpha a, ka hihmang a; hih manthat sipsip a a om masiah uh ka nungkik kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A thohnawn theihlouhna ding un ka hihmang sipsip a, ka satzan ngiingei a; ahi, ka khenuai ah a pukta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nang galdou din hatna in n’on gak a; hon sualmite ka nuai ah na nuaisiahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hon hawte ka hih manthat theihna ding in, kei hondoute ngawng na honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amau a dak kimvel ua, himahleh hondam ding kuamah a omkei uh. Toupa a en ua, himahleh a dawng kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huaitak in ken lei a leivui bang in ka khennel dimdem a, kholak buannawi bang mai in ka tuanzak a, ka thehzak vekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nang ka mite kisualna apan leng n’on humbit a; namchih lutang hi ding in n’on kem hoih hi. Ka theih ngeilouh nam in ka na a semta ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Namdangte ka kiang ah a hong kipe ding ua; ka tanchin a zak tak un ka thu a zui ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Namdangte a tulmang ding ua, a insang ua kipan ling kawm in a hong paisuk ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Toupa a hing hi. Ka suangpi phat in om henla; ka hotdamna suangpi Pathian tawisang in om hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Phu hon laksakpa leh namchih ka nuai a koih sukpa Pathian;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hondoute apan hon domtoupa: Kei hondoute tunglam ah n’on domkang a, hiamgam mi lak apan n’on humbit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Huaiziak in, aw Toupa , namchih lak ah kipahthu k’on hilh ding a, na min phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A kumpipa adia Amah hotdamna insang ahi a, A thaunilh, David leh a suante tung ah tangtawn in hehpihna a langsak, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiaite David thu nanungpen ahi. Jesse tapa David, sangtak a dopsang a ompa, Jakob Pathian thaunilhpa, Israelte la phuaktu in a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa Kha in kei honzang in a gen a, a thu ka lei ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israelte Pathian in a gen a, Israelte Suangpi’n ka kiang ah a gen hi. Mi tung a vaihawmmi a dik ngeingei dia Pathian lau kawm a vai a hawm ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah ni a hongsuah a, mei om hetlou zingsang vak bang ahi dia, vuahzuk khit a khua hong siang a lei a loupa selnou mitmet bang ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian adin ka inkuan hiai bang hi kei mahleh, kei toh tangtawn thukhun a bawl a, bangkim kizentak in a hihkip hi. Aman khangsak kei mahleh hiai ka hotdamna leh ka deihlam tengteng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh Belial tate bel avek a ling paihkhiat bang ahi ding uh, khut a lak theihlouh a hih ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh amau khoih ding mi sik leh teipi a, a kivat ding ahi. Huchi in amun mah ah hal ahi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiaite David sepaih hangsante min ahi. Tekmon mi Joseph Bashebeth sepaih heutute lak a heutupa ahi a; amah khatvei thu a mi za giat thatpa Eznit mi Adino a chih mah uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah zom in Ahohi tapa Dodo tapa Eleazar ahi. Amah Philistia mite kidou dia a kikaihkhawm ua, a tou ua, Israel mite a paimang vek lai ua David kiang a sepaih hangsan thumte lak a khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah a thou a, Philistia mite a khut a kham matan namsau leng khahlou khop in a that hi. Huai nin Toupa’n nakpitak in a zouta a, mite a ma nung ah gallak thil la ding lel in a hong kiknawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah nung in Har mi Agi tapa Shammah ahi. Behiang tampi omna lou a Philistia mite a kikaihkhawm lai un, Israel mite a taikek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh amah huai mun ah ading a, a veng a, Philistia mite a that a, Toupa’n nakpitak in a zohsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sepaih hangsan sawmthum lak a thumte a hohsuk ua, buhlak lai tak in David kiang ah Adullam kawhawm ah a hoh ua; Philistia sepaihte’n Rephaim guam ah panmun a khoh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchih lai in David inn sung ah a om a, huchih laimah in Philistia sepaihte Bethlehem ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in tui a lunggulh mahmah a, “Bethlehem a tuileh tui, kulh kongkhak kiang a dawn ding hongpia om le uh aw!” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in sepaih hangsan thumte’n Philistia sepaihte a paltan ua, kulh kongkhak kiang a Bethlehem tuileh a vatawi ua, a hontawi ua, David kiang ah a paipih uh. Himahleh aman a na dawn ngamkei a, Toupa adin a bung khe zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Aw Toupa , hiai ka hihlouh ding dan; sihngap a kuante sisan ka dawn dia hia?” a chi hi. Huchi in a dawn nuam kei hi. Huai thilte sepaih hangsan thumte’n a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zeruiah tapa Joab unau Abisai thumte lak a a heutupen uh ahi. Teipi in mi za thum a sual a, a that a, thumte lak ah minhoih a loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thumte lak ah pahtawi tuak pen ahi kei maw? Huaiziak in, a heutu ding un a bawl uhi. Himahleh tungnungpen thumte lak a tung zou kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kabjil mi hangsan tapa Jehoiada tapa Benaiah thil thupitak hihpa in Moab mi Ariel tapate nih a that a; huchi in a hohsuk a, vukkiak hun lai in leikawhawm ah humpinelkai leng a vathat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aigupta mi, milian tak a that a; huai Aigupta mi in teipi a tawi hi. Himahleh aman chiang tawi in a vazuan a, Aigupta mi teipi tawi a va sut a, amah teipi in a sunlumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehoiada tapa Benaiah in huchibang thil a hih ziak in sepaih hangsan thumte lak ah min hoih a loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi sawmthumte sang in pahtawi tuak ahi. Himahleh tungnungpen thumte lak a sim tel ahi zoukei hi. David in amah vengtu heutu in a koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joab unau Asahel bel sawmthum lak a khat ahi: Bethlehem khua a mi Dodo tapa Elhanan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Harod mi Shammah, Harod mi Elika;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pal mi Helez, Tekoa mi Ikkes tapa Ira:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anethot mi Abiezer, Hushathmi Mebunnai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahohmi Zalmon, Netophath mi Maharai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Netophath mi Baanah tapa Heleb, Benjamin suan, Gebeah a mi Ribai tapa Ittai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pirathon mi Benaiah, Gaash luite a mi Hidai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Arbath mi Abialbon, Barhum mi Azmaveth;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Shaalbon mi Eliaba, Jashen tapate lak a Jonathan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Harar mi Shammah, Arar mi Sharar tapa Ahiam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mankat mi Ahasbai tapa Eliphelet, Gilon mi Ahitophel tapa Eliam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Karmel mi, Hezrai, Arba mi Paarai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zobah mi Nathan tapa Igal, Gad mi Bani;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ammon mi Jelek, Beeroth mi Nahari, Zeruiah tapa Joab galvan tawi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ith mi Iraan, It mi Gareb;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hit mi Uriah ahi uh. Avek un sawmthum leh sagih ahi uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan, Toupa hehna Israelte tung ah a hongtung nawn hi. Amau kalh a David tokthou in, “Kuan inla, Israel mite leh Judah mite simvek in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa’n a kiang a om sepaih heutu Joab kiang ah, “Israel nam tengteng lak ah Dan apan Beer–sheba pha in vialvak inla, mi bangzah ahi ua ka theihtheihna din simvek in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joab in kumpipa kiang ah, “ Toupa na Pathian in mite pungsak in bangzah a tam, a mun za leng, toupa ka pu in muta ve, himahleh toupa ka kumpipa’n bangdia huai thei ut se ahia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh kumpipa thu in Joab leh sepaih heutute thu a zouta hi. Huchi in Joab leh sepaih heutute Israel mite sim din kumpipa kiang apan a paikheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jordan gal a va kah ua, Gad guam laitak taklam a khaw om Aroer ah Jazer pha in om mun a khoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gilead gam leh Tahtim hodshi gam a tung ua; Danjaan, leh Zidon kimvel a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tura kulh leh, Hivmite khaw tengteng leh, Kanan mite khaw tengteng a va tung ua; Beer–sheba a, Judah simlam ah a paikhia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in gam tengteng a totsuah khit un kha kua leh ni sawmnih a bei in Jerusalem a hong tungkik uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab in mihing zah kumpipa a pia a; Israel gam ah namsau tawi mi hangsan nuai giat a om uhi. Judah mi bel nuai nga a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing a sim khit un David lungtang a nuam hetkei. David in Toupa kiang ah, “Ka thilhih ah nakpitak in ka na khialta hi. Himahleh tuin aw Toupa , na sikha thulimlouhna koihmang din ka hon ngen hi. Haihuai mahmah in ka na hihta” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zingsang a David a thoh leh David zawlnei Gad kiang ah Toupa thu a na tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kuan inla, David kiang ah, Toupa’n hichi in a chi. ‘Thil thum k’on tah a, na tung a ka hih ding in khat tel in’ ” a chi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in David kiang ah Gad a hoh a, a hilh a, a kiang ah, “Na gam a na tung a kum sagih sung kial a kiak hia? Na melmate’n a hondelh ua kha thum sung amau apan na taimang hia, Na gam a ni thum sung hipi a hong len? Hon sawlpa bangchi’n ka dawng dia? Kingaihtuah inla, honhilh in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David in Gad kiang ah, “Ka lung a zing mahmah mai hi. Toupa khut sung ah hon puklut sak in; a chitna lah a thupi mahmah ngal a. Mihing khut sung ah zaw hon puklut sakken” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n Israel mite tung ah zingsang apan hunseh tan hipi a lengsak hi. Huchi in Dan apan Beer–sheba tan mi sing sagih a sita uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Angel in hihse dia Jerusalem lam a, a khut a lik leh Toupa’n thil hoihlou hih a tup a lunghei thaka, mite hihmangpa angel kiang ah, “A hunta; na khutlik nawnken” a chi hi. Toupa angel bel Jebus mi Araunah phual chin ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in mi that angel a muh in Toupa a houpih a, “Ngai in, ka na khialta hi, dikloutakin thil ka na hihta hi. Himahleh hiai belamte’n bang a hih ua? Na khut in kei leh ka pa inkawte honkhoih zaw hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai nin David kiang ah Gad a hoh a, a kiang ah, “Kuantou inla, Jebus mi Araunah phual ah Toupa adin maitam va doh in” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in David, Toupa thupiak bang a Gad in a hilh bang in a kuan touta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Araunah in a malam a et leh, amah lamzuan a kumpipa leh a sikhate hongpai a mu hi. Huchi in Araunah a pawt a, a mai a leisi in kumpipa ma ah a khupboh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Araunah in, “Bang a chia ahia toupa ka kumpipa, a sikha kiang a a hong?” a chi hi. David in, “Mipite lak a hipi a khawl theihna dia Toupa adia maitam doh dia na phual lei din ahi ka hongpai” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Araunah in David kiang ah, “toupa ka kumpipa’n hoih a sak bang in la henla, lan hen: En in, haltum a lat din bawngtalte a om ua, sing din phual vanzatte leh bawngvante a om uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw toupa, hiai tengteng Araunah in kumpipa a pevek hi” a chi hi. Araunah in kumpipa kiang ah, “ Toupa na Pathian in hon dawng hen” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Araunah kiang ah, “Hilou e, a man pia in k’on lei teitei ding ahi. Kei lam a bangmah senna omlou in Toupa ka Pathian kiang ah haltum thillatte ka lan kei ding” a chi hi. Huchi in David in phual leh bawngtalte dangka sekel sawmnga in a leita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />David in huai ah Toupa adin maitam a doh a, haltum thillatte leh lemna thillatte a lan hi. Huchi in Toupa a gam tung ah a lungkimta a, Israel gam apan hipi a khawlta hi.
  </para>
</usx>
